                { author: "Mykola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "it was amazing experience, Suarez is a perfect guide and really helps a lot. thank you for the guide definitely recommend it", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7766347/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Cindy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "Edy, my driver was great, arrived right on the dot and got us back a bit early too. The atv experience was also such a fun way to see the sunset.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7765845/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7765846/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Harriet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Unreal experience Couldn’t fault the staff Our driver buddy was so helpful and talkative 100/10", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7711491/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7711492/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7711493/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Justin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "We love Harry Potter, and now we love Herry the Driver too! ⭐️ Herry picked us up right on time at 2:30 am for our sunrise ATV tour, and despite the incredibly early start, he was so friendly, upbeat, and communicative. He messaged us the night before to remind us to dress warmly because it gets chilly in the mountains, which we really appreciated. He didn't just drive us there - he took us into the ATV check-in, explained the process, and even showed us how to operate the ATV before we started. Along the way, he shared great recommendations for Bali and made sure we knew exactly what to expec", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7456492/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jacob", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-28", text: "Oh wow what a Tour, definitely worth the cost and time. The Sunrise at Batur was unbelievable and driving there with an ATV is the most fun and intense way. Through Streets, Fields, Sideroads and also steep Forest offroad section. Wow we loved it so much we would do it a second time just for the fun being on an ATV and enjoy this unbelievable feeling of freedom and adventure. The Guide was awesome and took Photos. We felt loved and welcomed", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7364082/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7364083/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-quad-bike-with-breakfast/7364084/1600.webp"] }
