                { author: "Madison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "The transfer was hassle free with an awesome driver! An amazing experience from start to finish with guides that were super passionate about the trek and the surrounding nature, 10/10!" },
                { author: "Martina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "I had an epic experience with this tour. Amazing guides, and the whole day was filled with a lot of beautiful activities- a jungle walk. Canoeing, swimming by the waterfall. And yummy food at the end. Higly recommend it!:)" },
                { author: "Marta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "An amazing experience made even more special by an exceptional guide! I absolutely loved this experience. The forest trek, the canoe ride across the lake and the waterfalls were all beautiful, but what really made the day so special was my guide. You could genuinely feel how passionate he was about sharing his knowledge. He took the time to explain things along the way, not because he had to, but because you could see that it really mattered to him. He was incredibly kind, attentive and always making sure that I was comfortable and enjoying myself. I felt completely at ease in his company and", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8614109/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8614111/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8614112/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Anastasia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "had a wonderful day with Edy (aka Edy the Blue) and Agung. I can see that these guys are genuine locals and really love and care for Munduk and enjoy seeing visitors have a good time. Agung was particularly informative about different plants (coming from a farming family), I enjoyed him pointing out different types of flowers and trees. The locations we visited were as advertised (i.e. very pretty) and actually not that crowded. the day finished off with a lunch at a local place where are all my dietary needs (gf vegan) were accounted for. thanks for an unforgettable day!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8475310/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8475311/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/8475312/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "We had an amazing experience on this tour! Kadek was an excellent guide. He gave us lots of interesting explanations throughout the day, was incredibly kind, and made the whole experience even more enjoyable. The itinerary was fantastic. We explored the jungle, went on a canoe ride, and visited an absolutely stunning waterfall. It was the most beautiful waterfall we saw during our entire trip to Bali! Our driver, who picked us up in Munduk and drove us to the different activity locations, was also very kind and drove very safely. We learned so many things during this excursion. Starting early", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/7912573/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/7912579/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/7912580/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Cyrille", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "Such a nice tour with a kind driver and a sweet guide. We enjoyed everything we have done thanks to them. We had a lot of explanations and good advice in an awsome landscapes. Thanks both of you Lode and Edy." },
                { author: "Julio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-05", text: "It was excellent but short if i consider the amount paid" },
                { author: "Ivy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "It was a really lovely tour, you get an immersive experience trekking through the jungle, canoeing across the lake is serene and lets you take it all in, and you get to observe the beautiful temples. Banyumala Waterfall was amazing to see, very busy and a decent hike to get down but worth it! Would recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/6135703/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/6135704/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/6135705/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jozsef", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-30", text: "We had a really great time during this activity! The transportation provided by our driver Erik was very smooth, he was always in time and ready to pick us up. Our trekking guide Gunk was also great, during the jungle trek he explained a lot about the local fauna and flora, as well as Balinese culture and customs. We also really enjoyed the canoeing on the lake! Our lunch at the local restaurant was exceptionally good, we loved every bit, especially the nasi campur!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/5050727/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/5050728/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/5050729/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jade", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "We had the most wonderful time! Our guide Tia was amazing taking us on the medium trek. It was such good value for money and highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Isadora", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-04", text: "I had an amazing tour day with the guide Kadek and the driver Jemi. They were really sympathetic, explained everything to me and gave me an amazing tour to the waterfall, temples, the twin Lake viewpoint and a delicious local food for a stop for lunch. They really showed me another side of Bali that I loved: Munduk! Loved the mountain side of Bali. I will definitely come back and I would totally recommend them. If you come, make the tour with them!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/4818308/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/4818310/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/munduk-waterfalls-trek-twin-lakes-and-temple-tour/4818311/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "melvin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-27", text: "I booked a trip and transfer to north Bali, the driver showed up and the ride was very smooth. My tour guide Kadek was very nice and he really took the time to explain a lot about the nature etc. At the end of the day it began to rain heavily, but luckily Kadek brought some umbrellas, so the rain was no problem, overall the experience was amazing! Thank you Guide Kadek and Driver Buda!" }
