                { author: "Linda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2024-09-22", text: "I need to say one thing in advance: the tour itself was great. The landscape was beautiful, our guide was really nice (though on the quieter side), and the food at the end was delicious. BUT we really weren’t happy with the organization of the whole thing. First off, we followed the GYG instructions to the meeting point. There was literally nothing there. Since we didn’t have a SIM card we then asked around at the other providers if they could point us in the right direction. 5 told us they had never heard of Gotik. Finally we found another provider who told us that Gotik was merged with them" }
