                { author: "Symone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-22", text: "Learnt a lot about the Keliki painting technique. So interesting and fun. Nyoman is a great artist himself and was super helpful at sharing tips and tricks on how to achieve a good piece of art work using these methods. He also was super patient and allowed me to finish my piece as it took me slightly longer than the allocated 3 hours.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1835603/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1835604/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1835605/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Annie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-12-19", text: "I loved learning new techniques today and meeting the family. Special time for me", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1653039/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1653040/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1653041/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Raine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-23", text: "I really enjoyed this painting class, the studio is set at the back of a traditional Balinese home, of which I had a tour of before starting. The studio is laced with paintings and is set in beautiful garden surroundings which really helps you to relax and channel your creativity. Nyoman is a good teacher and is very patient as you learn the techniques. He helps you when needed. The class took 4 hours rather than 3 incase to need to plan for this. I was given fruit and a coffee and a bottle of water too. Over all really enjoyed this and I was impressed with my painting skills after all these y", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1528263/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1528264/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/1528265/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Anja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "Es war ein sehr schöner Kurs und unser Lehrer war sehr geduldig mit uns, ich würde das jederzeit noch mal machen!" },
                { author: "Viktorija", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-18", text: "Ein ganz besonderes Erlebnis in Bali! Beim Miniatur Keliki Painting Experience durfte ich mein eigenes Bild komplett von Anfang an malen. Mein Guide Juli hat sich unglaublich viel Zeit für mich genommen und war die ganze Zeit sehr geduldig und aufmerksam. Der Workshop war eigentlich auf 3 Stunden angesetzt, aber ich konnte ganz entspannt in meinem eigenen Tempo arbeiten und die ruhige Atmosphäre genießen. Man merkt, wie viel Leidenschaft und Können hinter dieser traditionellen Kunst steckt. Es war nicht nur ein Workshop, sondern auch eine schöne kulturelle Erfahrung. Ich bin stolz auf mein eig", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/6728520/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/6728521/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/threads-of-tradition-a-miniature-keliki-painting-experience-in-ubud/6728523/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lizett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-12", text: "Loved this experience thank you Juli 🙏🏼" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-27", text: "Teachers were kind, impressively patient and skilled. Beautiful location and a great experience to learn and bring home a Keliki Painting. We went overtime and there was not a single sense of being rushed - it was about learning the final step (we could have stopped perfectly on time so it wasn't because they timed poorly). Granted was end of the day so no subsequent class, tho it bit into their down time!" }
