                { author: "Anne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-27", text: "We had an excellent day exploring East of Bali. Popo was a great driver and took care of us. He is also very knowledgeable, sharing his insights about Balinese culture with us. He’s also funny and took great photos. If you would like to explore the side of Bali that remains authentic, this tour would be perfect for you." },
                { author: "Funda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-19", text: "It was the best trip I have ever attended. If you want to see real Bali, this is your call. We saw traditional Balinese living. I used to had lots of places pinned on my google maps, from temples to farms, i saw it all thanks to this tour. My guide was very professional and he answered all my questions perfectly. I recommend 100%", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-villages-salt-farm-and-tirta-gangga-tour-in-ubud/1986975/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Brabander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-18", text: "We had a great day with our guide Gede Astrawan! He drive a safe way, answers all our questions and told us a lot about the Balinese culture. We saw a lot of nice traditional places and had a lovely lunch at the sea at Candidasa! 🌴🌞🚙", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/traditional-villages-salt-farm-and-tirta-gangga-tour-in-ubud/888547/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Valentina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-28", text: "Adi was my guide of today, he took around amazing and unique places explaining me the traditions, about the religions and about the way the locals take out the rice and salt. The trip is organized in a way that you can decide togheter with the guide where to stop and also take some wonderful photos. everything excellent. thanks a lot" },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-16", text: "I highly recommend this tour, I had the best time with my guide and driver : Komang Juniarta and Budiarsa. They both are really kind and knowledeable. Take the early pick up to be alone in Tirta Gangga, it's surreal to be in this beautiful palace without the crowd. Plus, Juniarta (Jhoni) is a really good photographer and will be able to immortalize the moment for you ! The village of Teganan is a must-see for me as it captures the essence and spirit of Bali." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Our driver was accomodating and was able to make sure we had enough time in between from salt farms, explaining to us about each place, and taking us to local spot for photos in a local rice field area. The all day driving was very helpful to make sure we got our pictures taken and had enough time in between to see and explore during downtime." },
                { author: "Anneli", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-12", text: "Wir hatten einen wundervollen Tag mit Gede! Er hat uns alle unsere Fragen beantwortet, sehr viel erklärt und ist toll mit den Kindern umgegangen. Highlights für uns waren der tolle Trekking-Pfad um die Reisfelder von Sideman, das leckere Mittagessen und die königlichen Gärten Tirta Gangga. Vielen lieben Dank!" }
