                { author: "Leon", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "We had an amazing experience on our Jeep tour with Delon! From start to finish, he was incredibly kind, friendly, attentive, and accommodating. He made us feel comfortable right away and was always happy to help and answer all our questions. The sunrise was absolutely breathtaking and definitely one of the highlights of our entire Bali trip. Delon made sure we had the perfect experience and took us to beautiful spots along the way. We were extremely satisfied with the whole tour and honestly couldn’t have wished for a better guide. He was professional, knowledgeable, and also made the experien" },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "What an absolute brilliant experience! Was so beautiful and much better than expected. Baim our driver was lovely, driving us 2.5hours to the meeting point and waited until we complete each experience, the Jeep tour, hotsprings and for food, then another 2.5hours back to our hotel, the car was clean and comfortable. Our Jeep tour guide Samm was fantastic, he took stunning photographs of me and my friends and played music for us on the way to the black lava. Everyone was so nice and welcoming. It was such a good experience and good value for money, I would definitely recommend it to anyone." },
                { author: "Kamilla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Amazing experience! Angga was very positive and spoke good English. We’re happy that he was our guide." },
                { author: "Ellie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "It was amazing! the guide took some lovely photos of us during the sunrise on the mountain, and then took us to see the black lava rocks as well. after the hot spring, our driver took us to a complimentary coffee tasting at a plantation which was way more fun than expected. and to finish we were treated to a nice meal. Our driver Ary was very friendly and sweet, he made sure we were comfortable the whole journey, overall it was a fantastic experience and well worth the money" },
                { author: "Bailey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Sunrise was great, jeeps were funny and the guide was brilliant with pictures etc. make sure you wrap up warm, seriously - we’re from England and had to get the blankets for hire - it is quite breezy up there but well worth the view" },
                { author: "Taylor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Mangku Merta was amazing from start to finish. We had a fantastic trip up Mt Batur. He explained a lot about what we were going to do & about the culture. He also knows how to take incredible pictures that we will cherish forever!" },
                { author: "Codie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Had a wonderful time. When I got to the spot to watch the sunrise the driver was able to take amazing pictures. Sunrise was beautiful. Next went to black rock, which was a lava field and got a closer view of the volcanoes. Then went to the hot springs, warm water pools with a great view. I didn’t stay too long because it was very windy and made it kinda cold. On the way back stopped at a coffee plantation and had one of the best coffee/tea tastings I’ve ever had. Lastly ended with breakfast at a beautiful restaurant with a great view. Never felt rushed and was encouraged to take my time at eve" },
                { author: "Karolina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "We highly recommend Ary as a driver! He was very helpful and friendly, easy to talk to, and recommended several great places for us to visit. We really enjoyed our trip with him and would definitely recommend him to other tourists visiting Bali!❤️❤️" },
                { author: "Cian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "We had a great time, Kadek Bali, he was very helpful and informative on the volcano, also great photographer 🙌🏻" }
