                { author: "Soof", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "It was an amazing experience. We were staying in Ubud but really wanted to spend a morning in Lovina to see the dolphins. We had an incredibly kind driver who picked us up from our villa, took us to Lovina, and brought us back afterwards. He knew the roads well and drove very safely, even though some of the roads were a bit challenging. Our tour guide was such a kind and funny man. We had to travel quite a distance before reaching the area where the dolphins could be found, but once they appeared, he did everything he could to make sure we could see them both above and underwater. Even after a" }
