                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "This was one of the best nights/mornings ever! The transport went smoothly; the driver was very nice. You get coffee with cookies before starting, and for the hike a lantern and walking stick. Our guide Nyoman was very kind and supportive; he knew exactly what to do; we feel very grateful to have this experience with him! We took enough breaks, and were served a good breakfast at sunrise. The hike is not for everyone, you need to be in good enough shape and really want the whole experience; I had knee surgery as a teen and still had a great time! The view is absolutely breathtaking, and we eve", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking-with-hot-spring/8653622/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking-with-hot-spring/8653623/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking-with-hot-spring/8653624/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Rebeka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "A once-in-a-lifetime experience! Everything was absolutely perfect. The transfer arrived right on time, exactly as agreed. When we reached the starting point, our tour guide was already waiting for us. He was incredibly kind,open, and friendly which made the whole experience even more enjoyable. I can highly recommend this experience to everyone!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking-with-hot-spring/8607080/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lois", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Amazing my driver was really friendly and made me feel very safe and welcome as a solo traveller. He was very punctual and provided a wonderful service overall. The lovely lady who took us up the mountain (our guide) was very considerate of our groups fitness levels and stopped regularly for breaks and warned us of difficulties along the way. She was very knowledgeable and gave us lots of extra information on the mountains and volcanoes. She was a real laugh as well which made the whole trek feel as though you were amongst friends even though we all began as strangers. Couldn’t recommend both", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking-with-hot-spring/8584202/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Georgia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Our driver Bagonk arrived exactly at the pre-arranged time of 2.20am. He was pleasant and communicated clearly both via messaging and in person. He was helpful when we decided we wanted to leave the group tour after the hot spring to due to tiredness, ensuring we safely got home. Our trekking guide Roman was entertaining and made the experience fun. He adjusted his pace to suit the group, which I appreciated. Overall, this activity is well organised and runs smoothly." },
                { author: "Chloe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "An amazing morning! Our guide up the mountain was very helpful and supportive during the more challenging bits and our driver for the morning, Bayu, was very attentive and a great help between the different locations." },
                { author: "Mehdi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Sintya made our hiking really great, making the group confident even during the more difficult parts of the path, I recommend this activity" },
                { author: "Elvin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Our guide Rina and driver Pasek were really helpful and welcoming. we received good breakfast on top 👌🏻" },
                { author: "Noëlle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Andy and Cukup where amazing, lot of info! He let us try fruit" },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "Jeri Parta was absolutely amazing throughout the entire hike! He was very calm, patient and attentive, always checking to make sure everyone was okay and asking if anyone needed a break. My girlfriend found some parts of the hike quite difficult, and Jeri was always there to help her, even holding her hand and guiding her through the most challenging sections. We really appreciated his kindness and support. Thank you so much, Jeri! A big thank you as well to our driver, Eka, who was very friendly and made the whole experience even more enjoyable. We had a fantastic day and would highly recomme" },
                { author: "Eleanor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "The guides on this tour were excellent! Alia was so lovely and kind and made us feel very safe. Our driver Deny was also really great, he was always ready and waiting for us and played some great tunes in the car too! The weather was fairly cloudy but we still saw some of the sunrise - but nonetheless it was a very well organised tour which I would recommend!" },
                { author: "Tarun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "We had a really great experience with our driver - Dek astra. He was with us throughout the day and was extremely helpful, kind and patient. He was very sweet to us and always made sure we were comfortable and had everything we needed. Really appreciated how friendly and genuine he was. Would definitely recommend him if you’re looking for a reliable and caring driver in Bali!" },
                { author: "Oliver", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Jesi our guide and Ari our driver were both brilliant. An awesome morning." }
