                { author: "Sharla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "The trip was absolutely amazing. My partner and I went horse riding, to the waterfalls and then we did the zip line in ubud. We had an amazing drive, Blank who drove us a more than 4 hours during the trip . He let us stop to get Bintang to drink in the car as well as him letting us smoke in the car. Blanc was so kind and friendly and by far one of the best drivers we have seen in Bali so far. 100% recommend Blank he is a legend! Thankyou Blank for such an amazing day and some great chats throughout!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/8570092/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/8570093/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/8570094/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Shabrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-31", text: "We had good experience to visit beautiful rice paddies, delicious coffee tasting at a coffee plantation, and amazing horseriding experience at Saba beach. The black sand beach was especially so cool, it was quiet when we came so we had good pictures and unique experience riding the horse with blue sky and sea. Our driver, mas Dede, was especially kind and understanding. We were late but he tried to accommodate us and never try to rush us. We really appreciate it. We also had good talk during the road trip. It was really pleasant. Recommended!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7868791/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7868792/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7868793/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Casey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "This tour was amazing! It was a long day so it was great to have such an amazing guide, Jay made sure we were comfortable, did all ticket collecting and showed us the best spots. My mum and I had an amazing day with Jay. He even let us play our music! Thanks Jay for a great day and looking after us 🙏", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7336949/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7336950/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/horse-riding-zip-line-tour-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/7336951/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Viktoria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "From the very beginning to the very end, everything was absolutely perfect. The organization and pick-up were smooth and well arranged, and even the journey back to our accommodation at the end of the tour was handled perfectly. Sudarmawan was incredibly kind, attentive, and genuinely competent. He was always in a great mood, very friendly, and made us feel comfortable throughout the entire tour. He explained so many interesting things to us and was always happy to answer our questions. What really stood out was how much effort he put into making our experience special. He went far beyond what" },
                { author: "Ida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Very good trip, my guide was Erriyakusa - very sweet and took great pictures. The horseback riding and waterfall was definitely the most amazing experience." },
                { author: "Lorraine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "What a fabulous day! So worth it! Our driver putu deo was brilliant so informative, kept us updated throughout the journeys, excellent photographer and captured the moments amazingly! Anyone who gets him is in for a treat!" },
                { author: "Daniella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "Wonderful day!! Yoga was absolutely lovely and so helpful!!" },
                { author: "Kirstin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "Sudarmawan was a fantastic driver! He even took us to an extra spot, a coffee farm, because I had mentioned I could go for more coffee. And then we wanted a late lunch and he was happy to bring us someplace delicious and wait for us. He also took lots of great photos of us! The waterfall, horseback riding on black sand beach (I wouldn’t recommend wearing shorts), and zip lining were all unforgettable." },
                { author: "K", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-05", text: "Suarez was an incredibly kind and friendly guide who took great care of me throughout the entire day! The horse riding on the beach was one of the most enjoyable experiences I’ve ever had, and it’s a memory I’ll never forget. The zipline was also so thrilling and a lot of fun! If I come back to Bali, I would definitely love to book another tour with Suarez. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Evangeline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "It was so good, our driver Yoga was a wonderful person looking out for our comfort and needs! Totally made our trip so much more enjoyable :))" },
                { author: "Rashed", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "Thank you for your honesty and professionalism. It was a wonderful trip in every detail. The guide, Budi, was sincere, friendly, and always smiling. He is a truly good man, and his service was excellent. I really liked him and highly recommend him. He the company in the best possible way. Thank you, Budi, and thank you all for making this experience so enjoyable. 🙏😊" },
                { author: "Tammy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-24", text: "I had an amazing day on this tour and would highly recommend it! The itinerary was fantastic, including horse riding, a beautiful waterfall, and an exciting zipline experience. Each activity was well organised and offered something unique. A special thank you to Donny, who was an exceptional guide throughout the day. He was incredibly hospitable, friendly, and welcoming from start to finish. As a solo traveller, having such a genuine and engaging guide made all the difference. Donny went above and beyond to make sure I was comfortable, having fun, and getting the most out of every experience." }
