            reviews: [
                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "great tour and great guide , went off the beaten track which I liked. would def do again", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8346279/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-25", text: "Agung was a great guide and our small group of 6 all enjoyed his and each other's company. Everything was very well organized from the pickup in Ubud to the meeting points and breakfast in the coffee plantation. The biking was relatively easy and a great way to see the countryside and the life of the local people. Having cycle skills on a multiple geared mountain bike would make the trip more enjoyable but there's only a very small track uphill that you could walk if not.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8346029/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8346030/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8346031/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Spanidis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "everything was perfect, we have a very nice driver and ride to the point of start ,that we met with our guide Putu. Putu is a very kind and friendly guy. the activity was like riding with a friend!he gave us so much informations that only locals can explain to you!Very safe also for families.highly recommend", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8217153/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8217154/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/downhill-bike-tour-with-rice-fields-volcano-and-meal-in-ubud/8217155/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Rod", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-16", text: "Really great trip - our guide Anga was awesome. Had great English and was really passionate about explaining Balinese culture. My wife and I now better know and appreciate what's behind the beautiful nature that comes through everyone we deal with in Bali. If only the rest of the world could catch on. The lunch at the end was also delicious. We didn't expect such great value as the price wasn't expensive at all." },
                { author: "Lauri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Great morning out, easy cycling, beautiful scenery, interesting stops, informative guide, good driver." },
                { author: "issaoui", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "I recommend this tour, wonderfull trip with nice guide, the views are amazing," },
                { author: "Debs", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Fantastic day out in Ubud ! Very professional from the moment you get picked up . Great communication, before you start. Driver (Nova) was a bundle of knowledge and very kind, and made the trip a lot of fun, and the option to make some stops at some standout attractions before you start cycling is an added bonus. The cycling was great , relaxed, lots of interesting facts along the way, and plenty of stops…. Our guide was fabulous and made the trip very enjoyable and relaxed, lots of fun…and very informative. finishing off with a delicious lunch at a local restaurant was the perfect way to end" },
                { author: "Simone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "We were met on time by both our guide Nova and our driver Ketut who were friendly and professional throughout the trip. We had an educational but fun stop at the coffee/tea plantation. The tastings were generous and you had the opportunity to purchase any products you wanted . We learnt a lot regarding culture, food, family, traditions and religion during our trip. We felt a real connection with Nova. We stopped at a school, a traditional house in a rural village and when we thought our experience was over we had a traditional Balinese buffet lunch, which was amazing. We felt safe throughout o" },
                { author: "Colin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "My mate and I did the bike ride down Mt.Batur yesterday…..it was fantastic…our guide was Hendra and he made everything super easy….started with a delicious lunch then went to the crater of Mt Batur for a look…..then the ride down through the villages….very quiet roads pretty much downhill except when we veered off into a rice field and also visited a family compound in a village….Hendras knowledge was great we both learnt a lot about Bali traditions…..one of the best things I’ve done in Bali……" },
                { author: "Wybe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "The trip was great; the communication with Dewa tours was very good. All cultural aspects of Bali were clearly explained. The bike tour from Kintamani is a must. Thanks for all your attention." },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "Our family of four took this bike tour as a private tour and would do it again without hesitation. The route is entirely downhill, making it completely manageable and fun for the kids, and the bikes were in great condition with reliable brakes. We passed stunning scenery, local villages, stoped at the temples, school and a traditional Balinese house. Lunch was delicious, and our guide was outstanding patient with the children, knowledgeable, and never rushed. Highly recommended for families" },
                { author: "Despina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-10", text: "We had an AMAZING time with our guide Adi and our driver! The tour was excellent, the hosting and the organising great and the places we visit one of the kind! Thank you both for this excellent experience!" }
            ]
