                { author: "Susanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "We had a great experience at the temple and enjoyed taking part of the water ceremony. Our guide Tia was amazing! She explained every step of the ceremony very clearly, as well as all other questions we had about religion and Bali in general. We highly recommend Tia as a tour guide." },
                { author: "Annalee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "My private tour with Tia was great from pick up and all throughout. We had a laugh in the journey together and then she helped me prepare for the water purification which was great and I fully recommend. It was great to have a female tour guide as a solo traveller and I can’t thank Tia enough for the trip and the amazing photos she took for me" },
                { author: "Stefanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Perfect trip, our guide Indah was very kind and informative, and she took very good care of us, would definitely recommend 😊" },
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "This was a wonderful and unique experience. My guide, Karba John, was very knowledgeable and friendly and guided me through the process of purification in the spring waters. I highly recommend this to anyone who is interested in Hinduism, history or spirituality." },
                { author: "Donna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-12", text: "It's my birthday and doing the purification at Tirta Empul was the perfect way to celebrate. Tia, our guide, was exceptional. She made it easy to understand the ceremony, the stories. She was warm and approachable. She was the best guide I've had during my Ubud trip. It's easy to go along the ceremony bec of her guidance. The price is very cheap so it's good because more people can afford it." },
                { author: "Alice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "I really enjoyed my time at Tirta Empul, thank you so much to Sandy for being such an amazing & knowledgeable guide! He made me feel so comfortable and explained in detail the history of the temple. We prayed together and he took some wonderful photos that I’ll treasure. He also gave me some great options for activities after the temple, the coffee tasting was amazing and so worth it. I can’t recommend this experience highly enough." },
                { author: "Nabarun", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "What an amazing experience. Right from the pick and drop our guide , Kar was extremely corteous and made sure we are comfortable. He explained every detail about the temple and ritual. The ritual in it’s own is a blissful experience, very peaceful and calms the mind and body. Must do when in Ubud!" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-03", text: "I had an amazing experience on this tour! Being picked up at 7:00 AM was absolutely perfect because we arrived at the temple before the crowds. It was so peaceful and we were among the first visitors, which made the whole experience even more special. A special thank you to Sana, who was such a kind, friendly, and professional guide. He made me feel comfortable from the very beginning, explained everything clearly, and made sure I had the best experience throughout the tour. Since it ended up being just the two of us, it felt like a private tour, which was amazing. I would highly recommend thi" },
                { author: "Julien", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Kar was very friendly and informative throughout the trip. He shared interesting insights about Balinese culture and the history of the temples, which made the experience much more meaningful. A very pleasant and enriching tour." },
                { author: "Seren", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "Sana is the best! We visited Tirta Empul together and join spiritual cleansing. Afterwards he brought us a coffee plantation facility. We saw the plants of coffee, herbs etc and tasted some coffee and tee types. It was at least ones in a life time experience. Thank you Sana!" }
