                { author: "Chinna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-29", text: "Nyoman was great! This experience was amazing. He’s great when it comes to ideas and with poses and helping you make great content! He also was great in helping direct my drone video. During your photoshoot he will show you your pictures to make sure you like them! His personality was amazing! Experience was a 10/10. Book for any photography and drone footage needs. Will be booking again before I leave Bali." },
                { author: "Marquetta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-21", text: "My photographer Artha was great. He made sure I liked my pictures and gave great directions." },
                { author: "Phillip", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-03-22", text: "I had a great time with nyoman. He made my experience so fun and memorable. He was professional and funny and made my day so very special. He is great at pictures, videos and making you have a great time. I will recommend his services to anyone, thanks again!" },
                { author: "Ashker", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-24", text: "Well I thought the ad was very deceiving showing photos of a flower pool. I thought I was booking a shoot at a flower pool, and was disappointed to find out it’s just for a shoot, no flower pool. In fact there is no option to book a flower pool, which is what I was trying to surprise my boyfriend with on his birthday. However, the photo shoot at the swings turned out very nice, and I really liked our photographer. He picked us up from our hotel and took some really nice shots and drone footage and we ended up having a great time. Highly recommend our guy Kadek. So I can’t give him less than fi" }
