                { author: "Amanda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "Trip was excellent Froggy was awesome your guide easy to understand explained thing really well would do it again with him" },
                { author: "Abigail", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "Froggy was a safe yet effective driver of this vintage VW! Had a great time talking with him and exploring Bali in the car" },
                { author: "Alex", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-03", text: "Many thanks to our driver, Agus who arrived on time and drove safely throughout the entire journey. Agus also took the time to describe various aspects of the scenery and Balinese life as we travelled through the countryside which made a fantastic experience even better. If you are a vintage car enthusiast, a ride in an open-topped VW Type 181 is a great way to explore the Ubud area and I recommend this tour without hesitation. Our thanks once again to Agus and Froggie (the boss) for a memorable experience, Terima kasi, jumpa lagi !" },
                { author: "Diane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-17", text: "It was an excellent day trip . Our driver Froggy was wonderful. I had my elderly mother with me and Froggy looked after her and helped her with everything. The activities were great , we really enjoyed the drive up to Mt Batur , the lava fields and the hot springs. Froggy was full of information and spoke very good English. We had lots of laughs . We would highly recommend this tour and Froggy as our driver . Thanks for a great day trip Froggy." },
                { author: "Erika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-21", text: "It was excellent and relaxing. Pak Made is very nice and friendly." },
                { author: "Georgie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-16", text: "Fantastic day - worth getting up early. Everything included and prepared for us by our fabulous guide Froggy. Love that Froggy shared a wealth of local knowledge with us along the way. Highly recommend - worth every penny." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-09", text: "Wayan Budi Bali was my tour guide. He was fabulous, his full of local knowledge and has a great sense of humour. I never felt rushed and really enjoyed the old VW ride to the volcano black lava and hot springs for a therapeutic dip. I recommend this tour with Wayan 😃" },
                { author: "Xavier", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-09", text: "It was great! Froggy called the day before to ensure we left early enough to make the sunset; I appreciated that. The tour was amazing. A very unique experience. Our day was sunset, volcano landscape, hot springs, lunch, coffee, all included in the price. We really loved the vehicle. We would recommend this activity!" }
