                { author: "Susana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-19", text: "We absolutely love Reval! After our first tour with him, we cancelled all our other bookings because we knew we only wanted to continue exploring Bali with him. He is not only super easy-going and sweet, but also genuinely cares about making your experience special. He took us everywhere, showed us hidden gems and breathtaking places, and made sure we felt comfortable and happy the whole time. Thanks to him, we discovered the real beauty of Bali in a way we would have never experienced on our own. Spending time with Reval felt less like having a guide and more like being with a good friend. We", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-atv-and-water-rafting-ubud/3859185/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-atv-and-water-rafting-ubud/3859186/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-atv-and-water-rafting-ubud/3859187/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Oscar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Great experience with the ATV and rafting activities. Everything was well organised and a lot of fun. Special thanks to our driver Marco, who was incredibly helpful and friendly throughout the day. Highly recommended." },
                { author: "Dylan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Was amazing day . Such a wonderful guide. He let us keep the bags in the car. Picked us up from our villa and transferred us to our new hotel. He had many great other places to go and knows bali very well." },
                { author: "Liberty", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-04", text: "We had an amazing tour with Reval, he picked us up promptly from the correct location and even dropped us off to our other hotel with no problem, we went on the atvs and white water rafting which was great fun and he was there waiting for us when we finished, he even took us to the coffee plantation by his recommendation, he was very friendly and knowledgeable about anything we wanted to ask, we really recommend him as a tour guide, his driving was great and we had a brilliant time." },
                { author: "Sofian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Top activité. Tres beau paysage , nous avons rencontré un tres bon chauffeur PAL . Il a été formidable tout le long du trajet serviable . Je recommande" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Indra is an amazing driver! He ensured our safety. He knows the ins and outs of the traffic, allowing us to have the best experience while avoiding the crowds. He was very attentive and took us rafting and ATV riding. Oh, and his photography skills are incredible! He happily took photos of us at the best spots using great techniques. Overall, the experience was a 9/10, but Indra made it truly special." },
                { author: "axel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "super activités ! quad et rafting , nous avons fini trempés , il aurait fallu prévoir des habits de rechange 😅 notre chauffeur était top , sympathique et professionnel , a recommander !!" }
