                { author: "Mabel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "Wayan and Nemo were amazing! It was a great tour and absolutely worth it. Wayan was an excellent driver-very patient and always ready to help us with anything we needed. After the tour, he even took us to a bank so we could get the different bills for our souvenir collection, which we really appreciated. Nemo is like a professional photographer because he captured incredible photos while we were waiting, during the sunrise, and at the lava fields. Highly recommend! Worth booking if you coming to Indonesia 100%" },
                { author: "Weronika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-09", text: "The trip was marvelous, we enjoyed the whole experience so much. Our tour guide Adi was so amazing, we loved every second of the trip. He offered a lot of information and insights, even took as to a wonderful waterfall which wasn’t in the original itinerary. Definitely the best guide in Bali, we would recommend this trip to everyone! We will remember this day for a long time. One of the best experiences in Bali for sure." },
                { author: "Joana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Hendra was amazing from the start, he picked me up at my hostel, always made sure I was okay and if I needed anything. Later, I joined Nemo and we did the Mount Batur experience by jeep. Nemo was incredible, even though I did the activity solo, he made sure I felt comfortable the whole time, took lots of photos of me and shared really interesting facts about the volcano. After that, I was back with Hendra, who took me to a tea and coffee tasting and then to the Bali Swing, such a fun way to end the morning. I loved the whole experience and would 100% recommend it 🤩" },
                { author: "morgan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-08", text: "My guide Eka was so friendly and really made the trip special for me. As well as the sunrise and swing, he also took me to Black Lava and a coffee plantation. I would thoroughly recommend this experience." },
                { author: "Bob", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-15", text: "An early start from Ubud, but well worth the trek. The weather was perfect and the sunrise amazing. My jeep driver, Nyoman, was amazing! He took such incredible pictures of me on the jeep! Defintley recommend this tour!" }
