                { author: "Poppy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-17", text: "Everything was great. Pick up come on time, enough safety equipment, great atv route with back up route when it’s raining. My husband was in his element as he used to have this when he was younger so he really want to go faster, but I’m crap at it, even when we still on the road I’m already stuck 🤭 so I decided to join my husband. Lucky I did cos after that the off road look scary for me 😆 We passed a beautiful hydrangea farm, then serene waterfalls. We also enjoyed the cooking class. My husband never likes chicken satay but now he did, in fact he eat most of the chicken satay. The whole day e" },
                { author: "Nina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "We enjoyed the trip to the maximum! The transport was smooth, Yudi our guide was great and accommodated even a stop at a tea shop. The exercise Che is recommendable, a great mix of action with the ATV, relaxation on stunning waterfalls and delicious food prepared along with a local chef. Thank you for this great experience! And additional we received the best videos !" },
                { author: "Delaney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-12", text: "We had the best time on this tour! Our transportation driver Adi was very helpful, kind, and funny. He was at our hotel early and helped give suggestions for Bali activities we should do later. The ATV rides and tour was super fun and muddy! Tour guides are awesome and the second waterfall was beautiful. For the cooking class they used purified water and made sure we felt very safe and comfortable cooking and eating all the food (especially for international travelers). The food was amazing and we learned so much about Balinese traditions and ingredients used in the kitchen. The food is very a" },
                { author: "Ashley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-06", text: "This was 10/10- if you’re debating booking it, just do it! I booked this hoping to make friends and ended up with a private experience, & it was still incredible. The ATV was so fun and adventurous! You get to go on this trail through the jungle, and it is so much fun. Kadak (ATV guide) was very attentive and helpful, and I felt safe the entire time even though I drove myself and didn’t have a ton of experience. Loved the waterfall and recommend swimming (there are a lot of stairs to get there but it is so worth it). The cooking class was great and everyone involved was so sweet. I was a littl" }
