                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-08", text: "One of the best experiences I had in Bali! The hike was a lot more challenging than I expected, but there are motorbikes that can take you most of the way up if you need. Watching the sunrise from the top of the mountain is worth it. I also loved visiting the hot springs and coffee plantation afterwards, it's an amazing way to see more of Bali. Our driver Prapte was very helpful and knowledgable, which made the experience more enjoyable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/5165527/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/5165528/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/5165529/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-04", text: "It’s an epically fun trip. Pack a light jersey for the top. You are hot but it cools fast. The views from up there are spectacular.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2999070/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2999073/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2999074/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-25", text: "This was an amazing trip with an incredible sunrise view and fun hiking experience. Our driver Dekwan was fantastic, very kind and easy to communicate with - making our experience very easy and smooth. Also, our tour guide Chalong (Sorry I don’t know how to spell it!) was amazing too, so nice and helped us all the way up and down on the hike. Our tour guide also took amazing pictures too.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2025586/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2025587/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-trek-and-hot-springs-tour-ubud/2025588/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Jane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Andi the driver was really good and picked us up from the villa. The hot spring was slightly underwhelming, very busy. But good spot." },
                { author: "Dominik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-11", text: "Beautiful trip, amazing views and really supportive guide! Worth all the effort and lack of sleep" },
                { author: "Saskia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-06", text: "It was a wonderful trip and we enjoyed the sunrise. Driver Kupit was really nice and picked us up directly at our hotel." },
                { author: "Naleska", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-11", text: "I was a great experience to watch the sunrise at Mount Batur. Is about 1.5 hours hiking. In the first 20 minutes if you don’t are able to make the hike there’s motorcycles rider waiting to offer a ride (paid of course), the guide Gede dawan was good he makes sure you are Ok and offer to do many pauses as you need. He also helps you with photos I was traveling alone to what was very helpful. The driver Agus was very nice and explained on the way my questions." },
                { author: "Ines", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-10", text: "I had a great time with our guide Wikan, very caring and very attentive to our needs, I recommend this excursion and good luck to the brave who wants to climb the volcano the effort is worth it, the view is amazing. ☺️ thank you also to the driver Depa who is a good guide." },
                { author: "Amy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-13", text: "This experience was incredible and such good value for money! We added the car transfer option only the day before and it was all organised quickly and efficiently for us via Whatsapp. The tour guide Petra was super friendly and allowed us to go at our own pace while doing the climb all while motivating us and offering a helping hand along the way! The climb was a little more difficult than we had anticipated at the beginning and towards the end but it is well worth it for the incredible views at the top. The hot springs trip afterwards was a really great way of relaxing after the early mornin" },
                { author: "Drozdovskii", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-11-29", text: "Thanks Rani for the good trip, everything was good 👌" },
                { author: "chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-05", text: "We enjoyed our tour to mount Batur, the hot springs and the coffee plantation! The advertised hours for each activity, was the time you really got. This time is sufficient enough to experience everything. Our driver, Supredi, was an excellent driver and very friendly! We had such a good time and he picked us up at the agreed about time at our hotel! The guides which guided us up and down the mountain were very friendly and helpful! They took some of us by the hand on slippery parts on the way up and down." },
                { author: "Ruby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-18", text: "Our driver Agus was amazing, making the day easy for us. Our guide Sar was fantastic and made the amazing experience even better, and made sure we had great photos of us. The views from the top were incredible - best thing i’ve done in Bali!" }
