                { author: "Cindy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "The tour was amazing. The track go from cute tiny villages, forest, a lot of temples to rice field. We made a stop at a local community shop for tea and coffee tasting. We then had an amazing lunch at a local restaurant in the middle of the jungle with view on the river. The food was amazing! Thanks again to the all team for that great day!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/8171039/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Julio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-27", text: "INCREDIBLE EXPERIENCE ALL THE TIME!! The arrangement from Made and the Tour Driver (Komang) plus de Cycling Guide (Komang) make this cycling tour an unforgettable adventure. It’s not just a simple cycling tour, it can be adjusted based on the skills and request from the customers (which was my case) to make a downhill a bit more SPICY but always SAFE. I highly recommend to do this tour if you want to experience the REAL BALI and have a lot of fun. Thank you, Thank you and Thank you again.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/6872611/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/6872613/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/6872614/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Nicolle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-30", text: "Made was an incredible guide. We rode along one of the most beautiful roads, passing through local villages, temples, and some of the most peaceful, breathtaking scenery. He even stopped so we could experience a traditional pig roast and took the time to explain the cultural significance of everything we saw along the way. I highly recommend this tour—it was truly unforgettable.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/5997983/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kintamani-downhill-bike-tour-and-firefly-watching/5997986/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sascha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Great, authentic experience. Our tour guide provided us with a “hands-on” Bali experience and amazing insights into local food, farming and culture. The cycling is easily doable as it is almost completely downhill - we took the option for a small detour with one strong but very short incline." },
                { author: "Charbel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "Amazing tour with insight into local balinese village and culture. Great tour guide" },
                { author: "Judith", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-09", text: "Descente en vélo très bien en dehors des sentiers battus et des touristes, visite d’un village balinais typique et repas au milieu d’une rizière." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "We hadden een mooie tocht met prachtige uitzichten en mooie plekken die we hebben bezocht. Wel vonden we de tocht veel zwaarder dan we van tevoren hadden gedacht. Dat kwam, bleek later, omdat onze gids ons op een alternatieve tour had genomen. Niveau was goed te doen maar wel handig om vooraf te checken. De andere mensen in onze groep, waaronder kinderen hebben de makkelijkere tocht gedaan. Eren was lekker en er werd goed voor ons gezorgd. De gids was aardig en behulpzaam. Wij hebben een hele leuke dag gehad!" }
