                { author: "andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "The trip has been amazing thanks to our guide Mangku: he’s been kind and interesting from the beginning to the end, leading us as a true inhabitant, trying to make us find the less crowded and theistic spot to feel the real Balinese atmosphere! He chose a very good Warung for lunch with an exceptional view and we’ve seen parts of this island we would have never seen alone!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7718648/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7718652/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7718653/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Melanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-18", text: "We had such a lovely day exploring Bali with our guide Komang! 🌴✨ He was kind, patient, knowledgeable, and made the whole experience feel smooth and authentic from start to finish. He shared so much about Balinese culture and traditions, took us to beautiful spots around the island, and always made sure we were comfortable throughout the day. On top of that, he’s also a very skilled photographer and videographer! He helped us capture beautiful memories throughout the trip and knew all the best angles and spots for photos and videos. I will definitely hire him again", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/6720452/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/6720453/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/6720454/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Notebaert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "L’excursion était très plaisante et magnifique ! Un gros coup de cœur pour Jatiluwih ! La cascade et le temple étaient également très beau à visiter. Un grand merci à notre guide Kar qui a été très attentionné, patient et nous a également très bien renseigné ! Je recommande cette excursion ainsi que notre guide Kar 🙂", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7413285/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7413286/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nungnung-waterfall-jatiluwih-and-ulun-danu-temple-tour/7413287/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Èlia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "We did the tour with Putu Sandi and it was great! He’s such a nice person and told us so many facts about Balinese culture. We loved the waterfall, temple and rice field. We asked to stop to have breakfast and he did it so kindly. We enjoyed so much the ride. We recommend so much doing this tour and Sandi!!" },
                { author: "Dominik", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-09", text: "Few beautiful places seen and many memories collected in my head thanks to trip gotik! This was worth every penny. Big shout out to Karba John as he’s the one who made the experience even better, best guide on the island! I recommend it to everyone!" },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-01", text: "Raka was an amazing host - we loved talking to him throughout the day and had a great experience at all of the attractions. We would highly recommend this day trip!! xx" },
                { author: "Ayla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "Lovely day trip with guide and driver Subi who picked and dropped us off at our Airbnb. We started at the NungNung waterfall, which I’d recommend as it was the highlight of the trip for us and now we had the most energy + least people there! Subi was very nice, told us a lot about Bali and was nice to talk too in general. He also checked in with us, what we felt like, what our needs were and adapted accordingly. We really appreciated that! Can recommend!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "cascata molto bella immersa nella giungla, ci sono molti gradini da fare ma ne vale la pena. tempio al lago Bratan molto suggestivo. le risaie un vero spettacolo! la nostra guida gentile, sorridente e competente." },
                { author: "Elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "La nostra guida privata Mangku si è manifestata fin da subito molto puntale, disponibile e preparata. Molto interessante la visita alle risaie di Jatiluwih; abbiamo potuto toccare con mano tutte la fasi delle colture grazie alle spiegazioni approfondite di Mangku e alle lavorazioni in corso del terreno, sia manuali che con i macchinari. Caratteristico il tempio sul lago Bratan. 500 i gradini per raggiungere le cascate di Nungnung, ma ne è valsa la pena." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Una actividad bien organizada que cumple con todo el itinerario propuesto. El guía realizó su trabajo de forma correcta y profesional, adaptándose con flexibilidad a las necesidades del grupo durante el recorrido. Una buena experiencia en cuanto a organización y logística" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "It was great. Our guide was really kind and told us a lot of interesting information. His english was very good. We enjoyed the trip, the places were beautiful!" },
                { author: "Ainara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "Raka ha sido un guía de 10, conduce tranquilamente mientras te explica cosas. Nos habló el día de antes para confirmarnos donde nos recogía y demás. Durante la excursión no llevábamos ninguna prisa, nos hacia muchas fotos muy chulas y nos encantaron los sitios que visitamos. Además le preguntamos muchas curiosidades y nos lo explicaba todo simpáticamente ya que tiene muchos conocimientos. ¡Os recomendamos mucho esta excursión y más si es con Raka!" }
