                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-07", text: "What an epic day, Donny is the best of the best, we had such a fantastic time and Donny our driver, our guide, our DJ and most of all our entertainment all day made the trip absolutely unforgettable! Thank you Donny we will look you up when we are back for more tours!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/5411598/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/5411599/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/5411600/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Chloe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-18", text: "A lovely day spent with Alberth as our tour guide/driver. Gave us lots of information regarding up coming festival in Bali! Quad biking was fun ( be prepared to get wet and muddy) welly’s and protective wear provided. Showers available definitely bring a change of clothes Lunch was very nice (veg only option and small portions) no rush from Alberth during the day was happy to take it slow, took amazing pictures for us at the waterfall and happily stopped at shops for drinks ect when requested! Overall nice day out! Thank you Alberth!!!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/4659815/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/4659816/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-gorilla-cave-track-atv-and-waterfall-tour-with-meal/4659818/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Carena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "Our day was fabulous. Our driver Saurez was very kind and accomodating. He changed our day at last minute because our daughter was sick, he even recommended some medicine to help her. On the day Saurez was incredibly kind, helpful and informative, sharing lots of knowledge and information on the Balinese culture. His English was very good which made things very easy. The ATV was great and the kids enjoyed it, the guide there was very helpful and a lot of fun. The waterfall was beautiful! Better than I expected. And Saurez took some great photos for us. Thanks for a fun day out day!" },
                { author: "Nikki", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-28", text: "Lovely ATV tour through a dense section of tropical forest with splashing pools for great pictures, the waterfall was simply gorgeous." },
                { author: "Kasey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-26", text: "MASSIVE shoutout to our tour guide and transport for the day DONNY! He made our day so comfortable, from being very fluent in English, to taking some incredible photos of us throughout the day. The waterfall was beautiful, the coffee plantation stop was excellent! The ‘Cat-Poo coffee’ was amazing also! The quad bike tour was so much fun! A light sprinkle of rain halfway through added to the overall challenge of the course. Would absolutely recommend both this activity and Donny as your driver!" },
                { author: "Jordan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-04", text: "Sudarmawan was a very friendly host and ensured we were comfortable and informed along the entire trip. Great experience, would recommend!" },
                { author: "Leila", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-27", text: "Adhe was very nice and helpt us with everything he evan brought us to try durian. Thank you for everything:)" },
                { author: "Linda", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-26", text: "What an amazing day we had! ☺️ The ATV guides were very professional and make you feel safe the whole time. Our guide/driver DekWah was exceptional. He is a very safe driver and he taught us a lot about Balinese culture and traditions. We highly recommend DekWah and this company for your ATV Bali adventure! Many thanks again for such a fun activity. Linda & Allan 💫💫💫💫💫" },
                { author: "Dave", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-31", text: "Awesome adventure and adrenaline. Wayan and other guides were Awesome 🇰🇪🫶🇮🇩" },
                { author: "Matthew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-13", text: "Great day well worth booking! make sure to book transport to get around to the places 👍🏼 Darma was so helpful and friendly 10/10 service 😁 highly recommend him" },
                { author: "Jennifer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-04", text: "Dedet was our guide! Would 100% do it again just to have him as our guide. He was so knowledgeable, cheerful and playful with our teens! The kids kept asking about him all night wanting to go back out with him. The ATV was amazing, coffee plantation a good experience- and so funny with teenagers, and the waterfall beautiful! Definitely recommend! Thank you Dedet again!" }
