                { author: "Cassidy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-01", text: "amazing! must do if you're in Bali. the view of sunrise was amazing and our jeep driver, Angga, was quite the photographer taking so many amazing photos, posing us, he was very kind and informative. our driver who brought us to and from the hotel, Dekwan, was lovely as well. they included tea/coffee and cookies before going up the mountain and a simple breakfast at the top, and then we got to explore the black lava area as well. on the way home we stopped by a coffee plantation where they gave us a generous amount of free samples of coffee and tea which was lovely. I definitely recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-jeep-sunrise-tour-and-ubud-zipline-adventure/7409841/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-jeep-sunrise-tour-and-ubud-zipline-adventure/7409842/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-jeep-sunrise-tour-and-ubud-zipline-adventure/7409843/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Melanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "We loved the activity, it s just stunning & we got the chance to have 2 awesome guides ; Albon & Kadek kutra whom have been so nice, kind, helpful & so much more. Everything is taking care of and you just have to let you drive though the experience by this profesionales. Recommend 10000%", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-jeep-sunrise-tour-and-ubud-zipline-adventure/7191895/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Mangku merta was a fantastic guide! He drove very safely, taught us a lot about the area on the way and was a great photographer. Very friendly and chatty, thank you Mangku Merta!!" },
                { author: "Fleur", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Rika was an excellent driver and guide bringing us to every spot. Our guide and driver at Mount Batur was also very kind and took many photos of us. They were both amazing and the tour was great!!! We loved the ziplining as well" },
                { author: "Colette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "Derek our jeep trek guide, was great, very attentive & took amazing photo’s! Looked after us to ensure we had the best 5* experience! Arya our transportation driver provided great service picking us up super early with a cherry smile & was very helpful with atv suggestions. Thank you Derek & Arya 🙏" },
                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-30", text: "Toni my driver was absolutely amazing, on time and really looked after me. Widi was my jeep driver and he was amazing too. I highly recommend this tour. A FANTASTIC experience ❤️🥰❤️" },
                { author: "Caitlin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-14", text: "Bayu was a great guide, lovely man, he was very friendly and professional, would highly recommend! Ablon was lovely during the jeep ride, very informative and made sure everyone was enjoying themselves 😊" },
                { author: "Claudia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-08", text: "This was one of the most magical mornings of my life. Watching the sun rise over Mount Batur was absolutely breathtaking — a golden sky spilling over the mountains and lake, with the world still wrapped in quiet. The jeep tour was such a fun and comfortable way to reach the top, and I couldn’t have asked for a better team to experience it with. Our main driver, Surya, was wonderful — punctual, friendly, and full of great stories about Bali. He made the early start so easy and kept everything running smoothly from beginning to end. And Kadek, our jeep driver, was amazing — skilled, confident, a" },
                { author: "Michael", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-02", text: "Incredible morning with great views. Bayu was really helpful and made the whole experience effortless" },
                { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-13", text: "Lanang was the best tour guide we’ve ever had! He took the most amazing photos of us and made sure we were happy with them. He kept the vibes up with the music and even asked for requests. Definitely recommend this tour and if you get a chance to ask for a jeep drive ask for Lanang!!" },
                { author: "Celeste", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-22", text: "Had a great time watching the sunrise and doing the zipline. Plus an added coffee tasting bonus 😋 Our driver, Rika, was so friendly and willing to make our day super fun." }
