                { author: "Jordan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "What a Lovly day! Got so much done and enjoyed the whole experience! The driver was Lovly he didn’t rush me what so ever. Would definitely recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/8427142/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/8427143/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/8427144/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-05", text: "Amazing day with Oka and Oka Mesari Tours. He is a wonderful tour guide and driver, making sure we beat the crowds at the first two waterfalls. Go early so you don’t wait in line too long if you want those Instagram pictures. Thoroughly enjoyed the day and highly recommend! Book with Oka.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/7956330/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/7956331/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-private-tour-tirta-empul-tegalalang-and-waterfalls-ubud/7956332/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Meric", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "We had a really great tour! Our guide, Leon, explained everything very well and was so kind and lovely. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Sean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Leonk is a very knowledgeable and enthusiastic tour guide that is accommodating to the needs of all on the trip. It was a pleasure to learn a bit more about Balinese culture and see some amazing sights. I’m delighted I chose this trip! If you only have a few days in Ubud, don’t want to feel like you’re missing out and like a more private tour guide, this is the one for you." },
                { author: "Anne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Thank you for an amazing day! Oka is a brilliant driver, so you feel very safe with him. He also has a wonderful intuition as to what might interest his customers the most, like quiet places or places with good Instagram foto opportunities. And he takes great photos of you! The tour had a very good variation, with one large waterfall, a smaller one with the opportunity to cool oneself off in the natural pool in front of the waterfall. Throughout the whole trip Oka was very informative with good insights into Balinese life and lifestyle, and especially his in depth explanations of Balinese reli" },
                { author: "Gung", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "We had an amazing experience on this tour! Everything was well organized and the whole day was enjoyable from start to finish. The waterfalls were beautiful, the water temple was very interesting, and the rice terraces were absolutely stunning. Our guide was friendly, helpful, and made the trip even more enjoyable. We also learned a lot about Balinese culture along the way. Definitely a great way to explore Ubud and I would highly recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Žan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Honestly, one of the best experiences we’ve had in Bali. Oka was an amazing guide and made the whole day feel personal by adapting the tour to what we wanted to do. He looked after us like we were family, made us laugh the whole time, and even took loads of incredible Instagram photos for us. You can really tell he cares about making sure everyone has the best experience possible. If you’re booking this tour, definitely ask for Oka. You won’t regret it, and I promise you’ll have an unforgettable time exploring Bali with him." },
                { author: "Roy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Very nice day! Thank you for everything wayan" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Oka a été un super guide ! Il a été très à l’écoute, il a adapté le planning en fonction de l’affluence et de mes envies. Il est également très sympathique, et a un certain talent pour les photos. Merci Oka pour cette belle demie-journée !" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Ottimo tour per fare le foto. Per chi come noi vuole principalmente immergersi nella cultura locale può essere meno carino. Il nostro Driver Mhadi è stato perfetto! Molto cordiale e voglioso di mostrare i valori della cultura balinese attraverso storie e nozioni. Tutto molto turistico, che non è un male per chi cerca questo mood." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Somos un grupo de 4 personas jóvenes y el guía fue un estupendo acompañante del día. Se preocupó de nosotros como si fuéramos sus hijos, estuvo atento en todo momento de lo que necesitábamos. Recomendamos este tour, en Bali, con Leonk nuestro guía, ya que aseguramos que va a ser una experiencia inolvidable. Gracias por todo lionk, eres el mejor" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "Oka adalah pemandu tour yang baik, dia sangat mengetahui area dengan baik bahkan dia menceritakan sejarah Bali, Pura yang ada di Bali Dan dia menceritakan setiap rumah mempunyai pura keluarga. Hari ini pengalaman kami sangat menyenangkan. Saya sangat merekomendasikan Oka sebagai pemandu dan merekomendasikan booking di tempat dan meminta Oka sebagai pemandu anda. Terima kasih Oka Best regard Kevin family" }
