                { author: "Sharita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-26", text: "We had a fantastic snorkeling experience! Everything was very well arranged and we really enjoyed the beautiful spots. Seeing the turtle was absolutely amazing and definitely the highlight of the trip. Such a special experience! The only downside was the GoPro rental. The company offered GoPro rental, but it seemed like everyone was given a different price. The people before us were offered it for 300k, while we were told 400k. Apart from that, everything was great and very well organized. A special mention to our driver / guide Nyoman, he was absolutely fantastic and made the trip even better", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-jemeluk-and-lipah-beach-snorkeling-adventure/7777815/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-jemeluk-and-lipah-beach-snorkeling-adventure/7777816/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Celine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-03", text: "Great! We saw so many fish and turtles and the weather was amazing Nicely organised - the road to the meeting point is quite bumpy and bad so be prepared for that and driving slow but otherwise really great", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-jemeluk-and-lipah-beach-snorkeling-adventure/2741064/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-jemeluk-and-lipah-beach-snorkeling-adventure/2741065/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-jemeluk-and-lipah-beach-snorkeling-adventure/2741066/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Kai", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-03", text: "Amazing! Can't recommend enough! Saw so many beautiful fish and turtles! Felt like I was in Finding Nemo" },
                { author: "Olliver", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-09", text: "it was awesome, real kind people, activity in it self was really cool, definitely worth it" },
                { author: "Mishel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-16", text: "Great activity! The guides were lovely and super helpful. The coral reefs were incredible - I have never seen marine life so beautiful. And there were turtles too!!! Amazing experience 10/10 would recommend." },
                { author: "Ophelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-14", text: "Great experience! Saw 2 turtles, lots of fish and was smoothly run. Organizer was super kind in helping me and was flexible as well." },
                { author: "Elisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-21", text: "Amazing tour to the best snorkeling spots in Amed. I was picked up right in front of my hostel by my incredible driver Yobali who never left me for the rest of the day. After we arrived in Amed he even hopped on the boat with me and took videos of me while jumping in the water and snorkeling! In Amed I’ve seen the most beautiful corals, three sea turtles, an underwater temple and lots of fish. For lunch Yobali knew a lovely restaurant looking over a rice terrace. And finally we also stopped along the way to try some typical fruits and drinks from local sellers, a beautiful way to discover Bali" },
                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-14", text: "It was such an amazing day from the start to the end. The driver was really nice and on time. The guides were super friendly and very careful and try to make you see as much as possible. I saw the Manta. I definitely recommend to do that trip with this company. You will not be deceived" },
                { author: "Galo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-21", text: "I was contacted by the host the day before, they provided me with information about the meeting point and time. Once there, I was provided with the equipment and instructions about the activity, everything started on time. The host is very friendly, the activity is 100% recommended." },
                { author: "Jan-Christoph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-08", text: "Very Good snorkeling experience. Private Tour with a boat to good snorkeling places. I really enjoyed it and recommend it." },
                { author: "Marie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-06-03", text: "It worth the price but it doesn’t last 4 hours like it’s written. It lasted 2 hours. And the pictures on the announcement are not the real one from the activity. But we were able to see a lot of very colorful fishes at the last stop. Even saw a baby shark ! Thank you :)" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "Superleuke snorkelervaring. De gids en de stuurman van de boor bracht me naar mooie snorkelplekken met prachtig koraal en mooie vissen. dVan de schildpadden zagen we er onderweg eentje zwemeen en op de snorkelplek een op de bodem. Het gezonken tempelstuk was ook mooi om te zien. De tocht over de zee met de smalle boot was geweldig!! 1 tip: zorg voor waterdichte tas /plastic zak voor je spullen. Bij hoge golven komt het buiswater met bakken over je heen. Op zich niet erg, lekker juist, maar daar had ik niet op gerekend. Misschien vermelden bij voorbereiding. Voor de rest een toffe ervaring!!" }
