                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-19", text: "Very good experience for the price, we saw sea turtles too! Would highly recommend. Staff were so friendly" },
                { author: "Jason", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-26", text: "Blue Lagoon Snorkeling and his team is amazing. The water was calm and crystal clear. Saw loads of fishes, nemo and stingray." },
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-19", text: "This was an excellent day out and great value for money. The snorkeling was fantastic. Would highly recommend." },
                { author: "Rebecca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-14", text: "The overall experience was good. It would have been helpful to have a few basic instructions (e.g., don't waste energy trying to swim deeper, just float and look down). Also, it would have been nice to have a ladder to climb down into the water instead of having to jump overboard, as we were a mixed age group and it was a bit difficult for the older members to get up on the side of the catamaran to jump off. Overall it was a great experience and I'd like to do it again." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Zuviele Boote gleichzeitig an den Spots, man hat keine Ruhe. Tanjung ist direkt neben dem Öl-Terminal, nicht wirklich romantisch. Es ist schwierig, bei so vielen Schnorchlern im Wasser dem eigenen Guide zu folgen. Das Meer war trüb und einiger Plastikmüll war zu sehen. Es gibt keine Achtsamkeit der Guides, den Müll einzusammeln. Und die Fische werden mit eingeweichtem Toastbrot angelockt, nicht sehr natürlich." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-03-25", text: "La actividad estuvo bien. Tuvimos problemas con el grab para llegar con antelación y la empresa no tuvo ningún inconveniente cuando le escribí y todo fueron facilidades. El snorkel en Tanjung Jepun fue increíble, precioso. Pero la verdad que blue lagoon dejó mucho que desear. Para ser un agua súper cristalina y que podría ser precioso, está lleno de basura y nadas entre botellas, bolsas, recipientes... Da asco. Además también había muchas minimedusas que picaban. Deberían tener las empresas un plan B o dedicar más tiempo en el primer sitio, si está tan sucio el otro. El guía fue siempre muy at" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2025-11-14", text: "Dusch och omklädningsrum även skåp för kläder saknades, eller erbjöds ej." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-29", text: "처음에 리뷰가 많이 없고 가격대가 싸서 큰 기대 안했는데 바다가 너어어어어무 맑고 가이드님도 너무 친절하고 친근하게 안내해주셔서 안전하게 스노클링 할 수 있었습니다" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-03", text: "Great! Really calm waters and a ton of fish." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-04-28", text: "Le guide était super . Il nous montre plusieurs endroits, nous prend en photo .. seulement on doit rester ensemble et il y avait plusieurs personnes . Ça peut être rassurant mais faut juste le savoir . L’eau était magnifique et on a pu voir une tortue ." },
                { author: "Greg", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-29", text: "Great activity to do when visiting Bali." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-12", text: "Last minute plan but definitely the smoothest! We had the most incredible snorkeling experience with Blue Lagoon Snorkeling. Made was an amazing guide and he took great photos of us with GoPro we rent. Tanjung Jepun were amazing!!! Really happy, would recommend them." }
