                { author: "Johnny", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "Unforgettable Ubud Day Tour! We had an absolutely fantastic time on the Ubud: Guided Rice Field, Waterfall, and Coffee Plantation tour! From start to finish, the itinerary was the perfect mix of Bali’s natural beauty and rich culture. The lush green rice terraces were breathtaking, the waterfall was so refreshing, and learning about (and tasting!) local coffee was such a fun experience. A massive shoutout to our driver, Dewa! He was extremely polite, friendly, and made the whole day feel effortless and comfortable. His warm hospitality and smooth driving really elevated the entire experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/7917223/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Rohish", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-19", text: "Arom the driver was so good and flexible. We were 7 people including 2 kids and 3 senior, the trip was well executed. We started at rice terrace, then driver was accomdative to go to tirtha empul temple ( not in plan) but because it was in the way, then coffee plantations and then waterfall. Travelled to Offbeat places and He skipped all the high traffic areas and we were able to explore the country side which is so beautiful. We loved the experience and highly recommend to other folks. We were also able to shop at local place. Extremely satisfied customers 🙂", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6743606/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6743607/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6743608/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "This was the highlight of our trip to Bali. Mudi was a brilliant guide, and taught us loads about Balinese culture and life. The coffee plantation was a highlight, giving a real insight into real Balinese history & culture as well as sampling fantastic coffees. Mudi did not rush us at any spots, and even offered to add item onto the itinerary if we’d like 10/10 would recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6360124/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6360126/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/guided-rice-field-waterfall-and-coffee-plantation-in-ubud/6360127/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-26", text: "Super nice day! Would really recommend it! Our drivers name was Mudi, and we were super happy with him! We wanted to do some other small stops along the way, and he found the perfect spots" },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-23", text: "Our excursion today was simply wonderful! We were lucky with the weather and our guide, Mudi. The rice fields looked incredibly beautiful, and so early in the morning, we were almost the only ones there. Mudi told us a lot about the rice fields and took many photos of us. The coffee plantation was also very interesting. Coffee and tea tastings were included. Afterwards, we visited the waterfall, which was breathtaking. Our guide was very helpful and took lots of photos! Since we still had some time, Mudi had another idea, and we drove to Manukaya. The excursion was fantastic, and thanks to our" },
                { author: "Obadah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-23", text: "Our driver, Amon, was friendly, punctual, and made the whole experience really enjoyable. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Victor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "We had such a beautiful day exploring Bali on this tour. The rice terraces were absolutely stunning, the coffee farm was a really fun and interesting experience, and the waterfall was the perfect refreshing stop. What really made the day special was our guide Mudi so friendly, kind, and genuinely welcoming. They made us feel comfortable from start to finish and shared great insights along the way. Highly recommend this tour if you want a relaxed day taking in some of Bali’s most beautiful spots!" },
                { author: "Karen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Wir haben sehr kurzfristig gebucht aber es hat alles super geklappt.Mudi, unser Fahrer, hat uns pünktlich abgeholt. Er war sehr freundlich und geduldig und hat uns viel über das Land und die Menschen erzählt. Wir waren bei Reisterrassen , auf einer Kaffeplantage, wo wir Lumbak Kaffee gekostet haben und bei mehreren Wasserfällen. Es war ein fantastischer Tag und wir können Mudi sehr empfehlen. Er ist ein perfekter Guide. (Wir waren zu viert mit zwei Teenagern unterwegs )" },
                { author: "Jacqui", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "Ajik communicated the day prior with us his pick up time and was on time and greeted us warmly. We had a smooth trip to the rice fields, coffee plantation and waterfall. We were wanting to try babi guling so Ajik took us to pande egi on the way home, would recommend this as an add on if time! Thanks for the lovely day!" },
                { author: "Nachida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "Une excursion complète pour faire un maximum de choses en une journée : temple, cascade, rizière et plantation de café" },
                { author: "Ilian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Superbe expérience Nous la recommandons !! Nous avons été accompagné par Mudi durant toute la journée. Il nous a guidé dans les plantations de riz afin de découvrir et mieux comprendre le processus de production du riz. Il nous a guidé tout au long de la journée (plantation de café et deux superbes cascades) et a participé à rendre cette journée encore plus agréable." },
                { author: "Ewenn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "Super activité à faire pour une journée ! Paysage magnifique et dégustation de café et tea excellente. Merci à Sari pour nous avoir accompagné tout au long de la journée et à ses supers conseils !" }
