                { author: "APPERE", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "Nous avons fait l’ascension du Mont Batur en quad au levé du soleil et c’était juste exceptionnel ! Puis on est redescendu dans les champs de lave, et nous avons passé un super moment avec nos guides ! Anang est une personne adorable, vous passerez à coup sûr une bonne matinée 🤍", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6686404/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6686405/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6686406/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Riley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-06", text: "Great fun :) best thing I did in Bali", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6534635/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6534636/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-sunrise-atv-ride-and-rafting-adventure/6534638/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Joanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "This was an incredible trip. The atv part was very much 4WD, and the sunrise was beautiful at the top of the mountain. The rafting part was also incredible, but be aware it included a few hundred uneven stairs up and down to get to the river. The rafting itself was very fun, also very safe. The organisation was perfect. Overall, excellent trip." },
                { author: "Joe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-15", text: "Monparis & baros was really kind, and made our experience a moment to remember, speak very good English and a great amount of time to enjoy the view and and fun! Would definitely come back and recommend them! Thank you Mae&Joe" },
                { author: "Clara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "Nuestro conductor Dandy, fue muy puntual y amable, nos ayudó con todas las gestiones y estuvo pendiente de nosotras para todo lo que necesitasemos. Recomiendo mucho la experiencia con lo quads y el rafting!" },
                { author: "Lea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Die Aktivität war klasse! Das Quad fahren wurde kurz geübt und es wurde drauf geachtet, das jeder damit zu Recht kommt, im Dunkeln sind wir zum Berg und die Aussicht war super, der Sonnenaufgang wunderschön und auch das kleine Frühstück war gut! Das Vulkangestein war cool und die Fahrt mit dem Quad dorthin war lustig! Das Rafting war ein Mega Erlebnis und das Essen dort war danach auch sehr lecker!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "We had a great day and really enjoyed the whole tour. Gunawan picked us up on time and everything was very well organized from start to finish. His English was not perfect, but it was enough for some nice small talk, and he was always very friendly and welcoming. The most memorable moment was when I only wore shorts for the early morning volcano hike and got really cold. Without hesitation, Gunawan gave me his own blanket and went without it himself so I could stay warm. He also made sure we didn't miss any of the tour benefits. We didn't even know that a free meal was included, but he reminde" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-09", text: "Super Kombination. Adventure pur. Mit dem Quad/ATV zum Sonnenaufgang über dem Mount Batur. Anschließend mit dem Quad durch die bizarre Vulkanlandschaft. Abschließend Rafting mit Dschungel feeling. Super nette Guides…" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-08", text: "Je recommande à 100 % ! Gede s’est occupé de tous nos transferts entre les différentes activités, ce qui a rendu l’expérience très agréable et sans stress. Le tour en quad était incroyable, surtout avec la vue magnifique au lever du soleil. Nous avons ensuite profité d’une dégustation de thés et de cafés avant de partir pour le rafting. Le déjeuner était très bon et tous les guides étaient vraiment au top. Franchement, rien à redire !" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-03", text: "everything was perfect from the beginning to the end. the communication was fast and easy. atv tour and sunrise was one of my best experiences so far. the quads and tour guides were great as well. the rafting was so much fun as well. everything was fast no waiting times and clear constructions. would def do it again and recommend it to everyone. 10/10" },
                { author: "Jan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "Sehr guter Trip👍 Abholung und gut organisiert. Bei jeder Antivität nette Guides. Sonnenaufgang lohnt sich definitiv und die Abkühlung beim Rafting ist 👌🏼" }
