                { author: "Bernadette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "This was a wonderful experience to make and learn about canang sari from a local women doing them since she was 6. It gave me a new appreciation for these beautiful symbols of Bali.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canang-sari-offerings-experience-and-balinese-blessing-in-ubud/8114537/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Florence", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "Absolutely amazing ! I had the best time, the ladies running the experience were so kind. I will be recommending to everyone. Thank you for sharing your culture with me and being so patient ! 🤍", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canang-sari-offerings-experience-and-balinese-blessing-in-ubud/7809300/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canang-sari-offerings-experience-and-balinese-blessing-in-ubud/7809302/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canang-sari-offerings-experience-and-balinese-blessing-in-ubud/7809303/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Julie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "One of the best activities we have done in Bali, we learnt so much and got to understand more about the Canang Sari offerings. The blessing was just magical. highly recommend" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Hele leuke en interessante activiteit als je meer wil leren over de balinese cultuur. De gids laat je zien hoe je de offeringen maakt die je overal in Bali tegenkomen en laat daarna zien hoe een ceremonie werkt. Hierin doe je dan ook mee. Wij hebben een top ervaring achter de rug." },
                { author: "Anja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-22", text: "Uns hat die Canang Sari Offerings Experience & Balinese Blessing richtig gut gefallen. Ich war zusammen mit meinen Eltern dort und es hat unglaublich viel Spaß gemacht. Wir wurden mit Sarong und Kebaya eingekleidet und haben sehr viel über die Ofergaben in Bali gelernt. Ganz große Herzensempfehlung! ❤️" },
                { author: "SARA", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "Una experiencia preciosa que recomendaría sin dudar. Todo el equipo fue increíblemente amable y atento desde el primer momento. Respondieron con paciencia a todas las preguntas que tenía y se notaba que disfrutaban compartiendo su cultura y sus tradiciones. Además, tuvieron el detalle de ofrecerme desayuno, lo que hizo que la experiencia fuera aún más acogedora. Me encantó aprender a elaborar el canang sari en un ambiente tan cercano y auténtico. Me fui con una sonrisa, habiendo aprendido mucho y sintiéndome muy bien recibida. ¡Muchas gracias por una experiencia tan especial!" },
                { author: "Chiara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "Bellissima esperienza: è stato come entrare nel cuore di un gesto culturale e farne parte. Le accompagnatrici di questo viaggio sono state fantastiche: accoglienti, simpatiche, presenti. Consiglio vivamente quest' esperienza per rendersi consapevoli di un gesto tanto comune quanto intriso di valore." },
                { author: "Irina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "We had a great time with our guide Ita and her grandmother!! 🤗 she is very knowledgeable about Balinese culture and Balinese Hinduism and was able to explain everything to us and answer all of our questions. We were welcomed with Balinese breakfast (little cakes) and we got to wear the traditional clothes. Making the blessings is a crafty activity which we enjoyed and it was very interesting to learn about the reasons behind every aspect of it. We ended the experience with a guided prayer to bring us a calm mind and to pay gratitude to our ancestors. The space offers many activities such as yo" },
                { author: "Roland", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-17", text: "It was an awesome experience! We also got to talk a lot about the balinese culture while learning to do the offerings. A peacefull and recharging start of the day!" },
                { author: "Anina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "Es war eine sehr coole Erfahrung. Alles wurde Schritt für Schritt erklärt und jeder konnte in seinem Tempo arbeiten. Ich empfehle dies sehr für Leute, die gerne die Kultur von Bali besser kennenlernen wollen." },
                { author: "Sara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "Esperienza fantastica, sono state molto precise e pazienti nella spiegazione su come fare i Canang Sari e ne abbiamo fatti alcuni anche noi. Alla fine abbiamo fatto tutti insieme una preghiera. Super consigliato se ti vuoi immergere al 100% nella cultura locale." }
