                { author: "Kelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "we had the best day. Newman was our private tour guide, he was so friendly and knowledgeable. The heavens opened and we had rain like I have never experienced. he made us umbrellas from leaves before running back to the car to get our real umbrella! The swing was thrilling, the rice terraces beautiful and the waterfall magical, but the monkey forest experience topped the day with a baby monkey climbing up my soaking trousers to have a cuddle. 100 % recommend this trip and hope you get lucky and get Newman as your tour guide.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/7125930/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/7125931/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/7125932/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "William", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-29", text: "We have a fantastic day which was only because Strawberry our driver was first class not only was the experiences amazing his knowledgeable and helpfulness made it for the whole family", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/6904485/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/6904490/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hayley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-19", text: "Our day trip was the best of all time these two guys are the best tour men in Bali to have they are really nice and funny and really easy to get along with and with our group of four every location was really fun but if you go with a bigger group with them try and behave it’s not easy for two guys to control a lot of people but other than that their camera work is amazing it’s really good we where all very impressed and had such a good day hanging out with them and should have got a group photo with them definitely going on another tour with them next time we want to visit places or when we re", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/2385577/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/2385578/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/leke-leke-waterfall-monkey-forest-and-jungle-swing-tour-in-ubud/2385579/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Josephine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-23", text: "It was an amazing day and Karba Jon was lovely and supported us every step of the way." },
                { author: "Afra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-08", text: "An amazing day with our driver Sumadi! He was friendly, informative, and accommodating from start to finish. We thoroughly enjoyed our day." },
                { author: "Katy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-27", text: "The trip was amazing! would highly recommend to anyone coming to bali. Our tour guide was Bobby and he was so lovely and attentive as well as being very informative about all the places you go visit." },
                { author: "adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-05", text: "Sandy was brilliant he was a great tour guide we learnt a lot from him, had a lovely day exploring. We would highly recommend this trip!" },
                { author: "Charity", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-24", text: "Karba John was a great guide. He answered all of our questions and explained the history at each stop. He really made the day enjoyable and it could not have gone better." },
                { author: "Murray", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-25", text: "We really enjoyed the monkey forest and seeing all the monkeys running around. The guide was great with showing different things in the forest and temples and explaining the plants and their uses. An improvement would be to perhaps include rice terraces (as promoted) as we did see rice paddies but not terraces. Also water in vehicle would be an advantage as we did exhaust the ones we brought early as it was a hot humid day" },
                { author: "Shannen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-18", text: "The tour was amazing! My favourite was the Monkey Forest, the monkeys were so cute! our guide was also amazing! Widi made sure we were comfortable and he was extremely knowledgeable about everything I had to ask! I would recommend this day trip to everyone!" },
                { author: "Brianna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-23", text: "Krishna was a great guide. Took lots of photos. Clean car and good driving" },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-26", text: "Adiari was our guide today on this tour. What can I say about him?.. he has been the best guide we’ve had so far! He was absolutely amazing!! He arrived early, was such a careful driver, knew all the shortcuts to get us places faster before they got too busy. He was very friendly, told us all about local traditions and explained everything from wildlife to the villages we drove through. And he was a truly wonderful photographer 🥰took so many beautiful shots of me & my husband. They trip was fantastic but mainly down to Adiari 🥰❤️" }
