                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-12", text: "This was an amazing experience. Not only did we learn how to make coconut oil and body scrub using traditional methods, but learned so much about Balinese culture. We got to take some of the products home too and have loved using them! The women that ran the class are kind, informative, and helpful. They really care about what they do and sharing their traditions and culture. Would totally recommend!" }
