                { author: "Anita", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-16", text: "We had an amazing morning We were picked up on time for a visit to the temple, and our guide was able to tell us a lot about the local culture and surroundings. A special thank you to our guide and driver. If I remember correctly, his name was Wayan sana. He made the experience", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/7191166/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/7191167/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/7191168/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-08", text: "Very insightful and fun tour. Andrian is very knowledgeable and gave a lot of information on Hindu, Balinese and Indonesian history. The temple and shrines are beautiful and not crowded. We only saw two couples, so I could really gasp the atmosphere of this site. I recommend to take an early tour (I had 7:30am), as there are a couple of stairs to get to the temple which later you have to go up again. With more heat that‘s even more difficult.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/4133398/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/4133399/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/gunung-kawi-temple-and-pakerisan-unesco-guided-tour-in-ubud/4133400/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-03", text: "The tour did not disappoint and the temple was even more beautiful than I expected - truly mesmerising and I felt so tranquil in the jungle valley. Ryan was an amazing guide. He was Incredibly kind and knowledgeable. He was really good at answering my questions about Balinese history and he even gave me a free trip to a coffee plantation afterwards." },
                { author: "Peter", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-29", text: "Ryan is an excellent guide who possesses much knowledge of Balinese culture and customs. The temples were powerful to experience early in the day. And we had enough time to stop along the way back at a coffee plantation. A very pleasant outing all up." },
                { author: "Chiara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "it was really pleasant to discover this temple and something more about Balinese culture" },
                { author: "Adedoyin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-21", text: "Indah our guide was personable, on time and her car was comfortable and very clean. she gave good background history of the temple, answered our questions about Balinese culture in general and the coffee tour afterwards was a welcome relaxing time after climbing all the temple steps." },
                { author: "Andrea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-26", text: "Kar our guide was really nice and really helpful he knows so much interesting things about the places and everything I really enjoyed it and I recommend it" },
                { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-26", text: "The Tour with our great guide Kar was awesome! He told us a lot about the culture of Bali, the religion there and also about the life with the nature & the communities in the countryside. He can answer all the questions & has lots of good recommendations for Bali. The temple is a really quiet place with only a few tourists, that respect the rules of a temple & behave properly and not only searching for the next Insta-Photo-Spot. The nature in & beside the temple calms you really down. We can only recommend this tour, because you can learn a lot in a short time with a great guide & a safe drive" },
                { author: "Andrew", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-22", text: "Ketut showed me so many experiences in Bali in our time together. Though I am a solo traveler, he and I had a great conversation throughout the day. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Derick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-12-26", text: "Great tour visiting an ancient site for old kings and officials of Bali. My guide, Agus, was really knowledgeable and spent time explaining and sharing the history of the place. Come visit for a low-key experience of Bali and to enjoy the valley scenery and the beauty of Bali's countryside." },
                { author: "Ariadna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-04", text: "Guia (Ryan) muy amable, nos explico varios temas de la cultura Balinesa con calma y de forma muy bonita, en cuento al precio del tour muy elevado para la media en Bali" },
                { author: "Caroline", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-13", text: "c’était extraordinaire. un peu raide pour les marchés mais cela vaut vraiment le coup!!" }
