                { author: "Yazan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-30", text: "firstly I wanna thanks our guide Pal for this more than fantastic tour! he was so polite and nice to us the whole day, ee had special requests and he did what we wanted exactly even if it was not in the planned schedule. The activity was so awesome, especially the last two waterfalls, it was so beautiful and almost empty of people so we enjoyed every moment and detail. I would recommend this tour for everyone reading this review, and if possible ask for Pal as a tour guide ;)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hidden-waterfalls-tour-with-pickup-and-drop-off-in-ubud/8439215/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hidden-waterfalls-tour-with-pickup-and-drop-off-in-ubud/8439216/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hidden-waterfalls-tour-with-pickup-and-drop-off-in-ubud/8439217/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Samer", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "My wife and I had a wonderful time visiting the waterfalls and coffee plantation with Gun! He was professional and a great guide! Definitely recommend this for anyone looking to see the waterfalls around Ubud :)", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hidden-waterfalls-tour-with-pickup-and-drop-off-in-ubud/7749245/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/hidden-waterfalls-tour-with-pickup-and-drop-off-in-ubud/7749246/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "Lovely experience! Gunn was incredibly helpful, friendly and flexible throughout the trip. He made sure we had a great time and took us to several beautiful waterfalls. Highly recommend Gunn for anyone looking for a wonderful time!" },
                { author: "Jo-Anne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-06", text: "Our day trip with Kelvin was absolutely amazing. He went out of his way to make us comfortable and happy. All waterfalls were spectacular and our tour of the backstreets was fun. He also took some fantastic photos of us. I would highly recommend him to anyone wanting a safe driver and a fun day out." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "We had a wonderful experience with our guide! He was very kind, attentive, and shared so many fascinating insights and stories throughout the tour. You can really tell he is passionate about what he does. A smooth and enjoyable visit—highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Unser Guide Pao war ein unglaublich freundlicher und hilfsbereiter Guide. Er hat uns während des gesamten Tages sehr unterstützt und uns wunderschöne Orte auf Bali gezeigt. Dabei war er immer für uns da, hat uns aber gleichzeitig genug Privatsphäre gelassen, sodass wir die Orte auch selbstständig erkunden konnten. Wenn wir Fragen hatten, war Pao jederzeit zur Stelle. Besonders schön war, dass wir heute gemeinsam sehr viel gelacht haben und dadurch eine richtig tolle Zeit hatten. Wir können Pao als Guide wirklich nur weiterempfehlen!" },
                { author: "Isabelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-20", text: "de belles cascades, un bon resturant et GUN un guide au top. La dégustation de café et thé était top. un grand merci à GUN qui est aussi un excellent chauffeur." },
                { author: "Kishan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "Taman Sari Waterfall has to be my favorite part of the trip. all the places were well selected and beautiful. I had a magical time with Pal, my guide. He is cheerful, friendly, and informative. I am so pleased with this trip and will be happily recommending to all my friends!" },
                { author: "Lindsey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "We had Pal as our driver. He was the best! We were a little hungover but he took great care of us. He is also a amazing photographer. We had a great day with Pal🥰" },
                { author: "wilfred", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-07", text: "We had a great day! The driver named Pal was the best we ever had!! Great guy who thinks of everything and was very good with the kids. The tour is definitely worth to Book. Enjoy it!" },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-03", text: "Our day trip was Amazing!! Had the best driver, Gun. He was beautiful. (Girls… if you want good photos, he’s your man!) Waterfalls were excellent and The coffee plantation was a nice touch to the end of the trip. The day wasn’t too long. 5/5 recommend" }
