                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-05-23", text: "ATV was amazing! The zip line and pool was far too commercial" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-05-08", text: "The actual getting to the top and watching the sunrise on Mount Batur was beautiful. A once in a lifetime experience. Also the guides were very lovely. However tandem ATV not a good idea as it’s so steep to drive up, I had to get off the back and walk in the dark at one point with no help and in boots which don’t fit. My husband got stuck 3 times. Think it would be better in the jeep. Then the rocky drive has given me a black bruise on my leg due to sitting on the bars at the back and I’m in a lot of pain now and was when we were driving even asking to stop. Also we only got 1 hr at cretya and" }
