                { author: "Leonard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-08", text: "Fantastic tour, we’ve visited coffee plantain, ricefields, monkey village & waterfalls. Very beautiful Bali Indonesia. Our guide Manyon speaks very well English, explained and provided us enough information about the whole tour. Manyon was very humble and friendly.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/2094862/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/2094863/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/2094864/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Annemarie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-30", text: "Santana war ein super witziger Guide. Wir haben sehr viel und offen mit ihm geredet. Die Tour war sehr ungezwungen & ein paar schöne Fotos gab es als Erinnerung. Santa‘ war immer bemüht, dass es uns gut geht. Er ist auf alle Fragen eingegangen & man hat gemerkt, dass er dies nicht zum ersten Mal gemacht hat. Der Besuch auf der Kaffeeplantage war ein Highlight. Wir haben eine Menge Tee und Kaffee verkostet und anschließend konnte man das was man verkostet hat auch für angemessene Preise kaufen (vor allem wenn man bedenkt, dass die Verkostung / Führung durch den kleinen Garten komplett kostenlos", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/971140/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/971141/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-full-day-tour-of-ubud-highlights/971142/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Marika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-20", text: "One of the best daytrips I have ever had thanks to my driver Bayu! He gave me good recommendations and options and made sure I had the best time ever! He was very careful, flexible and friendly. I felt very safe. I loved the activities and especielly the carpool karaoke with him! I couldn't evee wish for a better driver/guide! If you want to book a daytrip to Ubud, this is it! But I might not go to the monkey forest again, it didn't seem very ethical place." },
                { author: "Jessica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-24", text: "Brilliant trip, we did this excursion on our first day in Ubud was a great way to see lots of it with the rice terraces, waterfall, coffee plantation, temple then the monkey forest. Our guide was extremely helpful and informative throughout the whole trip. We enjoyed this day a lot." },
                { author: "Ethan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-21", text: "Beautiful trip! Agus is awesome! Wellspoken English and a fun, down to earth and friendly guy. Great tour guide! Beautiful scenery and drive! Learnt a lot of the culture and traditions here in Bali" },
                { author: "Aisling", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-18", text: "We had Ketut as our guide, he was good fun and helpful when it came to answering any of our questions. We were a group of 2x adults and 1x child. I'm not a coffee drinker but really enjoyed the coffee and tea tasting, the waterfall and monkey forest were big highlights for all of us as well. Great day out!" },
                { author: "Christine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-04", text: "We had the best time on our trip around Ubud. Pande was a great tour guide, very accommodating and was good to have a local explaining the area to us. Ubud is beautiful. Would 100% recommend." },
                { author: "Chiara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-10", text: "That tour was really nice and i really enjoy the time that i spent in all the locations. The guide was very nice and ready to answer to all my curiosity" },
                { author: "Bárbara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-07", text: "Our guide Santanu was always at the time,helping us with all in the trip. Was a good a tour,I appreciate it." },
                { author: "Megan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-30", text: "Bayu, who was my guide was very punctual and knowledge about the places in Bali. I visited the waterfall, the rice terraces and did the zip line - which I enjoyed." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-12", text: "Unser Fahrer Dama war sehr freundlich und hat uns alles gut gezeigt und erklärt. Wir hatten einen sehr tollen Tag mit ihm und konnten uns bei Fragen immer an ihm wenden. Ist auch auf unsere Sonderwünsche eingegangen. Wir würden ihn sofort wieder buchen" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-25", text: "Gede took us around and he was very kind gentleman and his car was very clean. Very informative about the island and its culture. More importantly he knew all the short cuts in order to get us from one place to another avoiding traffic. I highly recommend the company and Gede Thank you" }
