                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "Had a wonderful afternoon cooking multiple Balinese dishes with our instructors. There were both meat and vegan options available, we opted for the classic meat menu. We were able to harvest our own vegetables from their organic garden, from pandan leaves to cabbage leaves, the experience was amazing. Accompanied by amazing weather the open kitchen created a very relaxing atmosphere. The food was amazing and gave us a real insight into Balinese cooking, culture and cuisine. We would highly recommend selecting the morning option to experience the morning market like real local. One of the highl" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-24", text: "We joined the Pemulan Bali Cooking Class Farm, and we are honestly blown away! Everything was perfectly organized from the very beginning. We were picked up right on time and warmly welcomed. Our first stop was the local market, where we learned about so many different fruits and vegetables — and we even got to taste many of them. Such a great way to dive into Balinese cuisine! After that, we went to the farm, where we were able to harvest fresh vegetables from the garden ourselves. A really unique and unforgettable experience! Then the cooking class started — and what can we say: it was absol" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2025-05-07", text: "Hat leider nicht stattgefunden. Ich stand am Treffpunkt und hab auf die Gruppe gewartet. Aber leider ist keiner gekommen. Um fair zu sein, muss ich dazu sagen, dass ich leider auch kein Datenvolumen hatte und mich keiner erreichen konnte und an dem Tag ein Hindu Feiertag war. Zurück im Hostel habe ich den Veranstalter versucht zu kontaktieren und ihm meine Nachricht geschrieben und gefragt, ob ich den Kurs einfach an einem anderen Tag nachholen kann, darauf kam leider nie eine Antwort. Das fand ich sehr schade. Ich hätte den Veranstalter auch sicher einmal anrufen können, was ich nicht gemacht" }
