                { author: "Noa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-12", text: "Het was ge-wel-dig!! We hebben echt een onwijs leuke en prachtige ochtend gehad en dat allemaal te danken aan onze tourguide Wi. Hij maakte foto’s als een professional, is super aardig en meedenkend en zorgde voor een enorm goede sfeer. Het uitzicht vanaf mount Batur was adembenemend, iets wat ik nooit meer zou vergeten! Deze tour is echt een aanrader en hopelijk krijg je Wi als tourguide, voor de beste ervaring ooit!!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mt-batur-jeep-sunrise-and-taman-sari-waterfall-tour/4219853/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mt-batur-jeep-sunrise-and-taman-sari-waterfall-tour/4219854/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mt-batur-jeep-sunrise-and-taman-sari-waterfall-tour/4219856/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Euan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-08", text: "Excellent tour from start to finish, abit unlucky with the weather by the views were still rewarding. Jimmy my driver was exceptional easy to access and a good Jeep guide was very informative" },
                { author: "Lotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-06", text: "I had a beautiful sunrise tour today and want to sincerely thank my driver, Krisna. The pickup was punctual and very pleasant, and right from the start I felt well taken care of. Throughout the tour, Krisna was always there exactly when I finished each activity, making the whole experience smooth and stress-free. His calm and friendly manner made the day truly enjoyable, and I was able to fully appreciate the tour. Overall, it was a wonderful morning with impressive views and excellent service. I can genuinely recommend Krisna and am very grateful for this great experience." },
                { author: "Albin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-13", text: "We all loved the whole day. Our travel guide was Dekwan, he was awesome, and a great help!" },
                { author: "Thomas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "Surya was a great driver I highly recommend him very friendly and also tour guide was great and beautiful sunrise 10/10 🙏" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-31", text: "An excellent activity, stunning views and well worth the early start. Our morning was made even better by our fantastic guide Cipto, a very skilled driver and he went out of his way to take some gorgeous photos for us to remember the incredible sights." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-10", text: "L’esperienza ci è piaciuta molto, accompagnata tutto il giorno dal nostro autista canterino Ronald" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Lanang was a great driver and the trip was a lot of fun 🤩" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-10", text: "We joined the sunrise Jeep tour with a visit to Taman Sari Waterfall and had a fantastic experience. Our driver Ridho drove calmly without rushing or risky overtaking, played great music, and even asked for our preferences. His English was excellent, and he shared interesting insights about Bali, its culture, and traditions. Our Jeep driver Niks also made us feel safe at all times, drove carefully, offered to take photos, and carried a delicious breakfast for us. The whole trip was wonderfully organized, the pick-up went smoothly, and the experience itself was truly memorable." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-15", text: "the whole experience was amazing" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-18", text: "We had a great morning with a beautiful sunrise! Our driver, Kadek, was super friendly and took some great pictures. The tour is highly recommendable and a great vacation memory." }
