                { author: "Samantha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "It was an amazing day! A perfect way for us to spend the day seeing so many wonderful places in Bali. Suma was a great driver-so friendly and helpful and he made sure that we saw everything we wanted and had enough time doing each activity we wanted to. Thank you for a lovely day Suma!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/7794146/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Suma was our guide for the day, who could not have gone further to make our excursion a success. I had expected a shared tour bus to collect us, but it was just us. The car was clean and comfortable, with drinking water provided., Suma was immaculately turned out, friendly, articulate and knowledgeable. He tailored the itinerary to us, keeping us entertained and informed as we drove around the key spots. If it were possible, I'd award Suma six stars out of five, for going above and beyond. We were walking the monkey forest together and Suma would meet us at the exit. However, a huge rain storm", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/4681912/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/4681917/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/4681920/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Kristine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-09", text: "Endra was our guide. He’s very nice and he knows so much about everything. We had a great time. We were sad that it had to end. We will surely recommend this to our friends who come to visit Ubud.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/4558623/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/private-all-inclusive-tour-with-lunch-in-ubud/4558624/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Barbara", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "Mandy customized our trip to see all the highlights plus added others based on meeting us. Took into consideration some walking limitations we had. The lunch was in a lovely local restaurant and it was excellent. We would highly recommend Mandy as a tour provider and will recommend him to our friends and family" },
                { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-11", text: "Our guide Gusti has good knowledge of the local culture since he is a native of Ubud. He came dressed in a traditional attire which we appreciated very much. He has a very pleasant attitude and kind to guide us through the sights, specially the Tirta Empul temple explaining the rituals and the different buildings in the area. His vehicle was clean and very spacious for two people and each person has a backpack too. He is also a good driver so we felt safe in the car with him. I highly recommend his tourist guide and transport services to others. Our tour was all-inclusive of all the entrances" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-25", text: "The driver mandaya dolar mgf ( Mandy) was just delightful and so knowledgeable and informative. I had a lovely day and would highly recommend this driver!I wish that I had booked him for my whole trip🙏🏼" },
                { author: "Elther", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-14", text: "We really enjoyed all the activities. The tour driver Mandy was really good. He didn’t only drive for us but also made sure we know the culture and explain what we see in the place" },
                { author: "Sangeetha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-09", text: "Komon was a very helpful guide. He took great photos of me. He explained the Balinese culture to me in great detail. I would certainly recommend him to other travellers too." },
                { author: "Sofia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-15", text: "A great day spent seeing the best cultural spots. Mandy, our guide, was fantastic. He spoke perfect English, super friendly and knowledgeable, he gave us so many insights and we learnt so much on the way. He even added two stops for us on the go to make sure we got the best of the best, so flexible and attentive. 100% recommend!!" },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-04", text: "Mandy was very friendly and professional. he was helpful in the whole trip and even advised me on the best cuisine and showed me around. I loved and enjoyed every part of it. I am definitely coming back." },
                { author: "Chay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-17", text: "We had an amazing experience with our tour guide, Mandy! He was incredibly nice, attentive, and made sure we had the best time. He took us to some truly special places that we wouldn’t have found on our own. His knowledge and passion made the tour even more enjoyable. We couldn’t have asked for a better guide and would definitely recommend him and the tours he offers to anyone looking for a great experience!" },
                { author: "Dechana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-09", text: "Our guide Komang was amazing. He was extremely knowledgeable about all things Bali especially Ubud. He was engaging and really open to sharing his culture with us. The day was jam packed and he offered a lot of useful tips and information that you wouldn’t know unless you talked with a local. He even showed us where to get our clothes laundered. He made restaurant suggestions told us about other great places to explore. Honestly a necessary part of thoroughly enjoying your experience is getting a guide and it doesn’t get better than Komang!" }
