                { author: "Matthijs", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-21", text: "Very friendly people at the park. Good instructions and secure safety checks. Nice views and several places to make good pictures." },
                { author: "Shay", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "The photographers/guys at the swing were so much fun and made you feel comfortable taking pictures and posing. Their energy was so much fun! I loved taking the pictures here. The zip line was short, but still very pretty! You could honestly skip the sky bike, not super exciting! But overall a great experience" },
                { author: "Marina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "We visited field during peak season and had an amazing experience. What surprised us the most was that, unlike Alas Harum, there were almost no queues. At Alas Harum we had to wait around 2 hours just for one swing, while here there were 4 swings available, 2 sky bikes, a zipline, and even a Superman zipline (which costs extra because it's not included in the 4-activity package). The rice terraces may not be quite as spectacular as those at Alas Harum, but the overall experience is even better. Everything is well organized, relaxed, and you actually get to enjoy the activities instead of spend" },
                { author: "Leanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-17", text: "U fun field staff were amazing and the activities brilliant, we arrived early - no lines and all our kids were able to do all the activities. Well worth the money Restaurant / cafe area needs a little work as to having the menu available not just a couple of each dish." },
                { author: "Sarina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "The guides were amazing and very funny/chill! It was our first time so we didn’t think about bringing small tips for them but next time we will! Definitely a thrilling short ride back and fourth from coconut tree to coconut tree! Will do the Superman one next time! Haha!" },
                { author: "Nicola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "So much fun! Kids loved the zip line and the scary high swing. All of the staff were encouraging and hilarious." },
                { author: "Dana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Fantastic morning. Staff were really friendly and helpful. They made the experience excellent fun. Pidi was so helpful and gave excellent tips." }
