                { author: "Katrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-05", text: "We absolutely loved this experience. We paid to be picked up and dropped back at our hotel. From the minute you arrive the fun begins. Firstly picking vegetables fresh from their garden then cooking a delicious meal to enjoy. We then went to visit a traditional Balinese house which was fascinating to learn about how a family all live together. After we went to the rice fields to see the fireflies. Unfortunately due to heavy rain we only saw a few but it was still wonderful to see. Highly recommended doing this trip", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/5706579/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/5706580/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/5706581/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Veronica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-03", text: "We had such a wonderful time!! Our guides were absolutely wonderful. Beautiful farm, exceptional food and a really fun light hearted cooking class. We then toured a traditional multigenerational Bali home. Our host was so super sweet. What a great experience. From there we went to a rice field, ate fruit and released fire flies. Simple, and perfect evening. A Bali must!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/4809044/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lyndal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-30", text: "Brilliant way to experience Ubud village life and culture. Made was an excellent host and so much fun", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/4436726/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/4436727/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/village-firefly-night-tour-with-dinner-in-ubud/4436728/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Patrick", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-20", text: "Made was a wonderful guide and has a lot of knowledge of the farm & the crops. The tour at his house was also very nice and gave me an impression how people live in Bali. And also seeing the fireflies at the end was a great experience!" },
                { author: "Joseph", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-20", text: "Loved catching tons of fireflies!! What a great night" },
                { author: "Karolina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-02", text: "i loved it, very nice people, delicious food and such an amazing cooking instructor. thank you so much for this nice evening" },
                { author: "Keri", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-29", text: "Well organised. Takes about 40 mins to get there. Lovely views of Bali life on drive and well worth it. Hosts really lovely. Enjoyed dinner we prepared, visit to family home and seeing the fireflies was a highlight. For those of us who live in the city, the sound of the ricefields at night was amazing." },
                { author: "Zenatalla", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "Renu (my guide) was so incredibly kind and helpful, he has an awesome sense of humour, and explained so much of Balinese culture and Hindu traditions. He went above and beyond and I felt very privileged that he showed me his home and I met some of his family. The firefly experience will forever be a core memory. I truly experienced childhood joy as an adult again. thankyou so much Renu!" },
                { author: "Taneash", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-04", text: "This was amazing and the absolute highlight of my holiday. My guide was brilliant, really engaging, knowledgeable and funny. I was given a tour of the farm and village, and was really humbled by everyone's friendliness. The cooking class was so good (naturally because I made it 😉). But of course the main attraction exceeded all expectations. Having dinner and sitting in a field surrounded by twinkly fireflies was magical. This is something I will never forget" },
                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-06-15", text: "It was very interesting and good to see Balinese culture and cuisine." },
                { author: "Arianit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-26", text: "Agus was very nice Guide he showed us the beautiful side of Bali and its Culture. The Cooking was also very funny and nice!" },
                { author: "Deepak", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-08", text: "It was AWESOME. It was fascinating learning about Balinese lifestyle. The cooking class was so fun! We picked up vegetables from the farm and cooked with that. They also gave us a cookbook. The guide was very warm and informative. The fireflies were magical" }
