                { author: "Magdalena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-10-25", text: "Fantastic trip! We had a great guide who speaks English very well, he was so friendly and kind, and is also a great photographer! Our guide shared with us a lot of interesting things about balinese culture and also fun facts. Dolphin trip - the experience we will remember for a lifetime! It is just unreal how beautiful they look in their natural environment. We also had a great boat captain, who is a true dolphin „hunter” 😊 other points, such Gitgit Waterfall and Ulun Danu Beretan temple were also definitely worth visiting. We also visited luwak coffee plantation and the staff there and experi" }
