                { author: "Suja", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "The tour was absolutely perfect! Komang was my guide, and he was so kind and knowledgeable, I was so lucky to have him. He was an excellent and safe driver. We went at the perfect pace visiting the waterfall, pengelipuran village, the temple then beautiful rice fields. Komang answered all my questions and was so knowledgeable. He is also an expert photographer and took the initiative to take photos of me at nice spots, so I have some very memorable photos and memories of this perfect day trip. I highly recommend this tour and its definitely one of the highlights of my trip in Ubud, Bali. Thank", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/penglipuran-village-rice-terrace-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/2389069/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/penglipuran-village-rice-terrace-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/2389072/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/penglipuran-village-rice-terrace-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/2389076/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Elizabeth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-21", text: "Highly recommend Gusde. We had wonderful day trip with him. Very professional attidude. He explained a lot about the balinese culture and habits." },
                { author: "Almu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-24", text: "Gunti Was the best, allí the time thinking of us, changing the itinerary so we would seize every visit to our liking. He is Amazing, we learnt a lot, and we are forever thankful. All the Luck and Love to you and your family!!" },
                { author: "richard", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-18", text: "Long was such a great guide, so knowledgeable about the culture, history, and geography. I really enjoyed my day with him. Penglipuran villiage was magical and I recommend all travelers to Bali go and see it." },
                { author: "Rosalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-31", text: "I was so glad to have Iwayan Kar as my Guide. He provided me with all the Information I wanted and explained everything very well. To summ up: it was a lovely chat and interesting conversation about Bali and It’s Culture, Tradition and Religion. If you want to see more than a pretty village, book this tour with him :)" },
                { author: "Nivethika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-06", text: "Exceptional Guide – The Best I Had in Bali! Wayan Kari was truly the best guide I had during my three weeks in Bali. He was absolutely exceptional, not only did he share so much valuable information about the places we visited, but he also gave deep insights into Balinese culture, religion and spirituality as well. You can ask him anything, and he takes real joy in explaining things with clarity and passion. Our conversation was memorable and enriching, and I’m incredibly grateful for the time we shared. Thank you ! 🙏 I wholeheartedly recommend him — 100%!" },
                { author: "Jodie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-14", text: "Wayan Kar is a very kind, professional and knowledgeable guide. His family welcomed us into their home for a cooking lesson and to learn about Balinese culture, religion and spirituality. He also took us to see beautiful waterfalls, temples and authentic rice farming. I strongly urge anyone visiting Bali to put this experience at the top of your bucket list! If you love coffee and/or tea, make sure you add on the coffee tasting - it was brilliant." },
                { author: "Honoka", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-03", text: "I took a trip with a great guide, Taru! It was a lot of fun to cook Balinese lunch together and I also enjoyed the coffee and swing. Penglipuran village was pretty! I hope I can come back to Bangli someday." },
                { author: "Lin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-21", text: "Truly a wonderful experience! I spent the day with the guide Iwayan kar who spared no details about the fascinating Balinese culture and all the rituals that they have, also I got to cook with his family in their traditional Balinese village home, we’ve made soo many dishes together and they were absolutely delicious. This tour is definitely recommended for someone who’s looking to gain an understanding about the authentic Balinese life, away from the touristy attractions. Thank you Iwayan kar for hosting me 🙏" },
                { author: "Szasza", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-10-25", text: "This was one of our favourite excursions! Sumi and his wife were incredible and we learned so much from Sumi about their heritage. Sumi was amazing in explaining about the Balinese culture and their heritage. It was so much fun cooking delicious food with him and his wife. Thank you Sumi for a wonderful experience and taking care of your heritage!" }
