                { author: "Haley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-11", text: "Our guide Adi was outstanding. Incredibly kind, considerate, informative and accommodating. We learned so much about each of the temples, Balinese culture and religion. It was a great day and such a good way to hit all of the sites in Ubud." },
                { author: "Zuzana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-23", text: "We had a great day trip with our tour guide Kadek. The price seemed appropriate, we felt that our guide paid attention to all our preferences, even added some stops to our itinerary and also told us a lot of interesting information about Bali and the places we visited. We would recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Timothy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-16", text: "It was an excellent and very flexible trip! Dayu (our guide) was super friendly and interesting, she explained us so much about her culture! And we arranged the trip together based on our conversation. We wanted more local experiences and food, so she took us to the local food market and really considered our preferences." },
                { author: "Kenneth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Adi was very nice and very helpful. He was most attentive and helpful with one of travelers with some mobility limitations. He was also flexible and allowed us to change the itinerary due to heavy rain." },
                { author: "Florence", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-18", text: "We had a wonderful time during our guided tour around Ubud. From exploring peaceful temples to meeting talented Balinese artisans, every moment was truly enriching. A huge thank-you to our guide Adi, the best guide we’ve ever had! His kindness, knowledge, and enthusiasm made this day unforgettable." },
                { author: "Umang", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-17", text: "Yani was fantastic. She arrived early, took me to more places than on my original itinerary, and even lent me cash when I realized I didn’t have any (I paid her back upon our return). She was warm, friendly and the perfect guide!" },
                { author: "aditya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-08", text: "Covered many places in a short time. This tour gives you the opportunity to be very flexible and completely personalize the things to do based on your wishes. The guide for today, Suru was able to cover the itinerary very smoothly with his experience, knowledge and patience on all the options visited. He also helped us save time in commute by mostly avoiding traffic hotspots" }
