                { author: "Suzanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-21", text: "Thoroughly enjoyed! Our driver Gede Jonny ensured the day ran seamlessly & was a highlight. With exc comn he was prompt, friendly & his personality & professionalism immed’ly put us at ease. Gede is an experienced & safe driver. His car was super clean & he provided us bott’d H2O. He gave us info along the journey & pointed out important landmarks & explained their significance. He guided us to obtain sarongs & locker key. The water purification involved walking waist high into water so we chose to change into bathers & use the c/room & locker to store our bags. Gede prov’d a full guided tour" }
