                { author: "Kerry", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "Me and my mum had the most wonderful day with Budiana. He was very informative and helpful. The whole experience was very relaxing and enjoyable. We got to finish with a swim at the waterfall. A highlight for us was the Coffee Tasting and Cretya Pools.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/cretya-infinity-pool-hidden-waterfall-and-water-temple-in-ubud/8113148/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/cretya-infinity-pool-hidden-waterfall-and-water-temple-in-ubud/8113149/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Danielle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-14", text: "we were lucky enough to engage the services of Yan our guide and driver. The Cretya Infinity Pool was a phenomenal experience everything you could hope for, Yan ensured we got there early enough to beat the crowds (as it gets busy later in the day) the views were spectacular and then Yan continued the tour by taking us to a gorgeous restaurant in ubud followed by a visit to the water temple were he guided us on the traditional side of Bali and then the waterfall. Along our journey Yan educated us on the magic of Bali, he’s very informative and he is what makes Bali so special to us, his kind h", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/cretya-infinity-pool-hidden-waterfall-and-water-temple-in-ubud/3780161/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/cretya-infinity-pool-hidden-waterfall-and-water-temple-in-ubud/3780162/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/cretya-infinity-pool-hidden-waterfall-and-water-temple-in-ubud/3780164/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "mariela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-24", text: "Everything was very pleasant: friendliness, good value for money, they accompanied us throughout, and the activity was in English, but they also spoke Spanish, so it was very nice." },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-28", text: "We had a fantastic experience with Yan on this excursion. What a gentleman. I would highly recommend this tour which covers swings, pools, waterfalls, temples and coffee. Yan was very knowledgeable, caring and flexible. Thank you so much, we had a brilliant day we won't forget." },
                { author: "Mel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-23", text: "We had a great day with our guide Yan. Yan is very informative, took us at the perfect times to avoid crowds. Had a beautiful day at Ubud infinity pool, waterfall and water temple. Amazing day, would highly recommend a tour with Yan" },
                { author: "Georgia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-10", text: "Great activity - our tour guide Yan was great so knowledgeable, friendly and accommodating! The views are breathtaking. We had severe rain but it was still great thanks to Yan. Such a great day would recommend, a lovely romantic day for couples 🥰" },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-25", text: "We had a wonderful day with Yan as our guide. Even though it was a rainy day we still had a great time. Can provided bottled water and umbrellas, and took care of all the entrance fees we needed to visit the locations. My favourites were the temple and the waterfall. I enjoyed tasting the different coffees at the plantation, but it would be nice to include somewhere that doesn't have caged civets. Over all, I definitely recommend this tour and our guide Yan." },
                { author: "Eya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-01", text: "We had a wonderful experience today thanks to our amazing tour guide! He was extremely kind, helpful, and knowledgeable. He showed us many interesting places throughout the day and really enhanced our visit. We truly appreciated his positive energy and the personal touch he brought to the tour. Highly recommended!" },
                { author: "Carmen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-24", text: "We liked the tour, nice objectives for visiting with a great guide. Yan is totally dedicated for his customers and he helped us to discover the hidden beauties of Ubud, Bali. I would definitely recommend him as a very good, kind and knowledgeable tour guide. Thank you Yan!" },
                { author: "Candra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-16", text: "My sister and I had an awesome day at Cretya Ubud's infinity pool, exploring the hidden waterfalls, and visiting the water temple. The views from the pool were amazing, and the waterfalls were a cool and peaceful spot in the forest. Lunch was tasty, and we loved the coffee and tea tasting. Our guide, Yan, was super friendly and knew so much about the area. Thanks, Yan, for a fantastic day! Highly recommend this tour!" },
                { author: "Keryl", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-20", text: "Ketut Maska was an awesome tour guide, very kind, helpful, on time and was very accommodating. We used him for our transfer back to airport too and arrived well ahead of time. Highly recommend him. Thankyou" }
