                { author: "Melanie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-01", text: "Sehr gut, gut organisiert!" },
                { author: "Payant", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2024-11-10", text: "It was a big mess. The meeting point was on the middle of the road, definitly nothing there. We tried to call the contact number but it was really hard to understand each other. Then a guy told us to go at a place, we went, it's was a quad bike company. The company said our booking was only for rafting while we actually booked a rafting AND quad bike tour, it written on the activity description. So at the end we did the rafting activity, it was actually good and the guide with us was really kind but we still didn't do the quad bike and you paid for it !" },
                { author: "Lucie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2024-11-09", text: "On c’est clairement fait arnaquer il n’y a que le rafting comme activité , le point de rdv faux on à galérer à trouver le vrai point de rdv . Après le rafting était très bien avec un bon buffet à la fin" }
