                { author: "Sanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Päiväretkemme oli erittäin onnistunut ja monipuolinen. Pääsimme kokeilemaan batiikin tekoa, nautimme lounaan riisiviljelmiä katsellen, tutustuimme balilaiseen tee- ja kahvikulttuuriin sekä kävimme vesiputouksella. Päivän päätti vierailu temppelissä. Oppaamme Wayan oli erittäin ystävällinen ja avulias. Häneltä opimme paljon balilaisesta kulttuurista. Suuret suositukset Wayanille.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/batik-workshop-with-optional-temple-and-waterfall-tour-in-ubud/6390968/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Melissa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "I booked this very last minute and Wayan was very accomodating. On our trip to the batik class we had great chats about Bali and its cultural history, answering all my questions I had! The class was lots of fun, and I’m glad I was able to squeeze it in on my last day. The people running the class, took lots of photos of me working away which was great as I attended solo - so had no one to snap pics. They then sent me the photos after the class. Wayan also stopped at a store so I could run in and grab a lock for my suitcase. I had a delicious lunch overlooking the rice paddies, then Wayan kindl" },
                { author: "Isobel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "I had a great day! Jun and the driver Leo did everything possible to make my trip. Memorable one. I spent as little and as much as I liked at each location and found it informative, fun, a mix of culture and nature 😊" },
                { author: "Beth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-21", text: "What a great day. The Batik workshop was so fun, and to do an activity that that represents the area was just a unique opportunity. The guide provided great information about the local sites and was so helpful. I learned so much about Bali and its people on this tour. Was worth even second and penny." }
