                { author: "Florian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-01", text: "Great experience, we had a lot of fun.. queens and staff are amazing, food is great. It was nice to interact with the queens and learn signing with the incredible host." },
                { author: "Daniella", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-27", text: "A great evening, filled with learning and great fun thank you, would definitely recommend ❤️" },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-28", text: "This is a very special place in Canggu that provides job opportunities for underrepresented groups of people, and therefore serves a very important social purpose. And that is paired with a fantastic and fun and beautiful drag show in a very intimate setting. To say I enjoyed the performance is to say nothing, my absolute highlight during the Canggu stay! Highly recommend it." },
                { author: "Peggy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-23", text: "The performers were fun and appeared to truly enjoy doing the show. The food was good. the service was excellent. we danced and sang and otherwise thoroughly enjoyed ourselves. 10/10 would recommend." }
