                { author: "Lina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-08", text: "An exceptional and truly memorable experience at Meuyah Cooking Class! My daughter and I learned so much from the executive chef I Nyoman Darsana. He is incredibly experienced, a fantastic teacher, and made the whole class fun and engaging from start to finish. The dishes we prepared were not only delicious but also surprisingly easy to recreate - we’ll definitely be making them again at home." },
                { author: "Maeve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-08-22", text: "It was good! The ingredients were pre-cut and measured for us which was helpful. The cook demonstrated what to do and then we would try it ourselves. We cooked three dishes in a short amount of time and there was lots to eat at the end of it! Gloves are provided, I do wish the chefs changed gloves more frequently and we were able to wipe down the bench as we were handling raw chicken and fish, while preparing vegetables and a dessert all in the same bench space. The table was covered in a tablecloth so not able to wipe down. I changed my own gloves multiple times while handling the food though" }
