                { author: "Jacques", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-04", text: "We enjoyed our trip with a super guide, a very kind and professional person.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-highlights-tour-w-canggu-black-sand-beach-chill/806962/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-highlights-tour-w-canggu-black-sand-beach-chill/806963/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/ubud-highlights-tour-w-canggu-black-sand-beach-chill/806964/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Eleanor", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-07", text: "We had the best day. Gede Susila (our driver) was incredibly helpful and friendly. He offered to take us to wherever we wanted in Ubud. He gave us several options to choose from, recommending different locations along our tour. We got to do so much during our tour including; swings photoshoot experience, seeing handmade wood caving, handmade jewellery, coffee plantation, waterfall, rice Terrance and a lovely restaurant to have lunch in between our tour. Gede Susila took us to the rice Terrence for our last destination (around sunset) knowing that it would be quiet and we’d get better photos. H" },
                { author: "Courtney", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-29", text: "Edi was an awesome guide! He allowed us to make the trip our own while showing us amazing cultural stops along the way." },
                { author: "Jeannette", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-05-13", text: "Nice impression of the beautiful surroundings and highlights. Friendly driver who was attentative to our wishes." },
                { author: "Amal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-01-06", text: "We had so much fun! Nyo Man showed us a great time. We traveled comfortably and felt safe as well. He took care of us and made sure we were having a great time all day. He even took pictures throughout the day and sent them all to us when we were finished. Highly recommend and would use him again on our next trip." },
                { author: "Maurice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-11-20", text: "I had a great experience. My tour guide was Putra and I have no complaints whatsoever. Putra made every effort to accommodate me and educate me about Bali. 5 stars from me. Thanks" },
                { author: "Serena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-10-11", text: "The tour was really interesting: one day spent in Ubud to see the rice fields, the waterfall, the black sand beach and the characteristic market. Our driver and guide, Margan, was extraordinary, he went above and beyond: he took some pics of us, explained us the Balinese life, religion, traditions and culture. He also drove us to a nice place to get some lunch. Highly recommend this tour and Margan!" },
                { author: "Sabrina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-09-03", text: "We had a great Tour with Agus. He was in point to pick us up in the Morning from the Hotel we had in the South. We had the Option to decide where we get first, because we stayed one night in Ubud and had another place to sleep. That‘s why we started with Canggu and saw a Surfer Contest. With Agus we talked a lot of the Bali Culture and our german Culture and History. The Exchange was very nice. Especially to understand to eachother. We got a lot of informations and Agus also let us Time alone. Agus spokes very good english and is really relaxed. We would book the Tour with him again. There is" },
                { author: "Fahima", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-07-03", text: "Our guide Jerry was amazing! Very informative and knew all the spots for great photos. He was patient and allowed us to do the tour at our own pace, which was good especially because I am pregnant. Be careful not to get too caught up in the coffee tasting or you will not have much time for the rest of the rice terrace and swings. Take an extra pair of shoes that you will not mind getting dirty as the trek to the waterfall can get muddy. Otherwise really worth the tour!" },
                { author: "Winky", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-06-11", text: "really enjoyed the trip. Ben, the guide, is very friendly and helpful. The rice terrace and swing were nice. Love the sunset at the Black Sand Beach." },
                { author: "Gordana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-02-26", text: "I was alone on this one, my tour guide Komang Yus was amazing, so friendly, restaurant Teba Sari where he took me for lunch was probably best meal I had in my life&accompanied with best view of the forest. Places were amazing, from rice terraces to waterfall, coffee is excellent! Must try! Don't be scared! And for finish, beach was great, my rec is to go to different place a bit up the Ecco Beach, is called Labrisa, pools, dj and sunset. Cheers." },
                { author: "Brett", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-01-22", text: "Our driver Gede Susila was extremely helpful, knowledgable and friendly. In addition to the waterfall, ricefields and black sands on this tour, we were offered customised options to see a range of craft galleries and attractions including coffee processing. I highly recommend this tour and driver. Some of the highlights included unscheduled stops for photo opportunities of the amazing countryside and farmland. These features were explained to us including many other aspects of the local culture." }
