                { author: "carolyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-22", text: "It was a memorable trip,as i was fortunate to be at besakih during the odalan ceremony,seeing the culture,the spritual highligh aspect of it,everything was graceful and unforgotten memories. Ari my tour guide and Wayan a respectful driver.Ari is knowledgable with the cultures and the origin of the temple,she also guided me thru the purification at tirta empul and also offered prayer ,which mean so much to me.I would come back and be guided again by Ari and Wayan.😁", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/6343781/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/6343787/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Yumi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-05", text: "本当に素敵な時間をどうもありがとう! It was a wonderful today! The panoramic view of Mt Batur and the lake in fresh cool air... was enough to recharge energy for myself. Additionally, Ulun Danu Batur temple which) I really wanted to visit was such a peaceful and memorable place to me, because of Yani, she is the driver guide! She suggested me to do meditation for a while there.. what a comfortable time! We went to Goa Gajah after here and did short meditation as well. I couldn't do this without Yani and am very glad to refresh myself and to know Balinese daily life! I am also appreciated her safe drive too! ( I", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4510886/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4510889/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4510890/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Roberta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-01", text: "Many thanks to Dayu (guide) and Toni (driver) for the fantastic tour today. You gave me a lot of information, got me safely from point A to point B, and gave me a wonderful day. I felt very comfortable. Plus, you always had a smile on your faces. It was fun. Suksma!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4040796/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4040797/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/customized-private-tour-with-a-female-guide-in-canggu/4040798/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Renee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Andina was amazing, she gave such good reccommendations. it felt lkke i was travelling with a local friend and i learnt a lot about balinese culture and places." },
                { author: "Alison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-08", text: "Lovely day, I really loved having a female guide as a solo female traveler." },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "Yani my lady driver was awesome. Yani speaks perfect English and was excellent at taking me to visit the best markets where I managed to find all my gifts for family. I’m travelling solo so having a lady to chat to was great. Highly recommend Yani 10/10" },
                { author: "Alena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-24", text: "We had a wonderful day with our guide Febri! She was open to all of our wishes and a very good guide. It was really fun to be with her amd we saw so much beautiful temples that day." },
                { author: "Annalena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-14", text: "I had a fantastic day with my guide Febri! She was so kind, caring, and made the tour really special. Everything was well organized, and I learned a lot about Bali. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Nic", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-11", text: "we had an amazing day trip with Dayu and her driver Tony. Tony was an ambulance driver during covid which made us feel incredibly safe in the car. Dayu was so knowledgeable and taught us a lot, from Balinese family life, to local traditions and about each location. The Luwak coffee farm was a great addition! thank you Dayu I will recommend you to anybody I know going to Bali." },
                { author: "Marta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-30", text: "We were lucky to have Febri as our guide during our stay in Bali, and we couldn’t be more grateful. She was incredibly kind, friendly, making us feel comfortable from the beginning. Her warm attitude and professionalism made our experience even more special. Thank you, Febri, for being with us and making everything so easy!❤️" },
                { author: "Souheila", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-13", text: "I had such a beautiful day on the Bedugul and Jatiluwih tour. Traveling solo, I truly appreciated how kind and attentive both my guide Ari and driver Wayan were throughout the day. The sites were stunning and well chosen, offering a perfect mix of culture and nature. What made the experience even more special was their flexibility — I asked if we could stop at Handara Gate, even though it wasn’t on the original itinerary, and they kindly said yes without hesitation. 🙏 thank you both for making this day special. I absolutely recommend this tour, especially if you’re looking for an authentic exp" },
                { author: "Carmen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-11", text: "Yani was 🤩 amazing!!! The weather was very bad in the morning of my trip and she suggested we go a bit later instead of not going at all and she was soooo right! The sky cleared out eventually and the trip was excellent! Yani was very friendly, she was fun to spend the day with and she tried to take me to more places despite the bad traffic in Bali! I totally recommend ❤️" }
