                { author: "Gardeep", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-07", text: "OMG!!! Where do we start from… we have travelled different countries had tour guides in most places however the tour guide we had today Bonito was absolutely amazing. He made us feel so welcomed and really comfortable. Nothing was too much. He was soooooo knowledgeable about everything. He was with us all the time making sure we are ok, we are enjoying yourselves. We understood the history and culture behind all the places we choose to see. I do understand that we paid however he could have just given us brief information and let us carry on with our day but he didn’t he went above and beyond." }
