                { author: "Jason", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-27", text: "overall this was a fantastic day. The ATV was amazing. you do go around in a lap and you just repeat that lap over a few times. monkey Forest was a great experience. the temple. another awesome experience and then the bali. overall amazing day! the downside was the traffic and then the distance in between places but that's expected. the guide very knowledgeable and experienced and helpful with photos.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/5017109/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/5017110/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/5017111/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Charlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-12-07", text: "it was an awesome trip and Samba was a great guide who took some nice photos and videos for me. Started the day out with parasailing and I decided to add on the hoverboard and jetskiing while at the watersport area. Then went on to do the ATV, rafting, and massage.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/4881898/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/4881899/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/all-inclusive-combo-adventure-ticket-with-transfer-in-uluwatu/4881900/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Seidy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-05", text: "We had an amazing day exploring Bali! The ATV ride, river tubing, Sacred Monkey Forest, and jungle swing were all so much fun and well organized. A huge thank you to our private driver, Komang Sparsa, who made the experience even better. He was friendly, knowledgeable, and made us feel comfortable throughout the entire day. We never felt rushed and appreciated all of his local insights. Highly recommend this tour, and if you can, ask for Komang Sparsa!" },
                { author: "Jimmy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-10", text: "The team was so good, we would give 10 stars if we could! The guide was so patient even the activities we chosen are far from each other. He’s happy to wait no matter how long we took and never catch an attitude or complaints. He gave us so many advices on places to check out in Bali and helped us save as much as money as we can from local sellers. We went to gate of heavens and that took us forever for photos but he was able to work it out and we finished all our activity on time and don’t feel as tired! Good itinerary planned" },
                { author: "Nancy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-03", text: "It was amazing! Eka is an amazing guide!! 100% would do this again and highly recommend Eka. I did parasailing, atv and spa! 10/10" },
                { author: "Hamza", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-11-06", text: "Oh the experience is more than fabulous we loved every bit of it ❤️ special kudos to our driver Sambe he taught us A LOT about balinese culture and traditions! I highly recommend booking with them and choose Sambe as a driver!" },
                { author: "Tom", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-15", text: "We had a really good day with Putu. Top guy and very professional. Helped us sort all activities so the day ran smoothly and stress free. We also had a good guide for the rafting and the quad biking fella was very good too. He got us some good pictures and there was only me and my wife on the quad tour. Good track for beginners and a nice touch to come back via the paddy fields. We saw a few other tours parked up and waiting a lot so glad we dis this one. We were quite nervous about the quads and rafying but Putu reassured us and the guides and equipment were professional and good quality. Wou" },
                { author: "Gisele", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-02", text: "Our driver Agus got in touch with us ahead of time to confirm our activities. We were picked up right on time, he was very friendly. We did the water rafting and ATV. Both were fun, the rafting was not on an intense river, we were able to take in the scenery and get our arm work out. The ATV track was fun, a lot of bumps and you get wet for sure. We passed 2 other group on separate tracks that didn't look as exciting." },
                { author: "Annam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-09", text: "Probably our favourite day in Bali- the ATV was so fun and bumpy! We went through a waterfall/forest track and it was so fun. The water rafting was the absolute highlight though; the local guide who was on our raft with us was hilarious and the actual activity was so fun- the walk down to the raft was a longgg staircase down so be aware, the walk back up was a killer too but definitely worth it. Our guide Komang was lovely and punctual even when we were running late, he made sure we got to do both activities. Overall a brilliant day" },
                { author: "simone", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-06-16", text: "Santosa was AMAZIIINNGG !! He arrived on time with some lovey cold bottles of water and took his time to explain soo many things about their culture. He came into our attractions with us and gave us personal guided tours for the full day. It was a pleasure! I’ve never wanted to tip someone more!" },
                { author: "Katie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-01", text: "Our guide Komang was exceptional, he told us all about the Balinese daily life, family culture, food and temples and was super responsive and well organised. He was very caring and helpful, taking pictures for us and showing concern. With 2 grandparents, 1 teen and 2 primary aged children as well as myself (F36) he catered to a wide range of interests for us. He also let us be quiet in the car when we were tired after the activities on our way back. His safe driving in the city traffic was terrific! We especially enjoyed the ATV for the afternoon rush and the friendly guides and the white wate" }
