                { author: "Patricia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-15", text: "This was a good half day tour ! The guide/driver was safe,nice and made sure to give me recommendations for the dance show seating and keep me safe from the crazy monkeys ! The temple view is beautiful at sunset and the dance show was entertaining! Thank you Agus Mahawan for a great afternoon in Uluwatu🙏🙏🙏", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/uluwatu-temple-tour-and-kecak-dance-at-karang-boma-cliff/5495604/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Charlie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-21", text: "Top effort from the lads and ladies performing the dance, ensuring the limited crowd all felt involved. Great experience would definitely recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/uluwatu-temple-tour-and-kecak-dance-at-karang-boma-cliff/5260350/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Diego", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Unforgettable experience. Our guide Oddy was fantastic. He picked us up directly from our hotel and even suggested a better departure time to help us avoid the traffic. He then guided us around Uluwatu Temple and accompanied us to the traditional dance performance, which was one of the most emotional and memorable moments of our entire stay in Bali. Finally, the day ended with an excellent seafood dinner at a restaurant by the sea. There’s really not much more to add: experiences like this, with guides like Oddy, are exactly what you need to make the most of a day like this." },
                { author: "Shelby", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-25", text: "The view was absolutely stunning and the dance told such a beautiful story! The performers were so fun and kind, this is a must while you’re in Bali!!" },
                { author: "Kajetan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-28", text: "Super experience! The guide was very friendly and knowledgeable, and the temple visit with the Kecak dance was unforgettable. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Gergely", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-17", text: "Everything was really perfect, Abu was the nicest guy, we are so lucky that we had him as our guide!" },
                { author: "Stephan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-14", text: "We had a wonderful visit to Uluwatu Temple in Bali! Our guide, Oddy, was amazing – super friendly, knowledgeable, and always ready to answer our questions. He told us so much about the temple’s history and even took beautiful pictures of us. It was a perfect day and we highly recommend this experience!" },
                { author: "Oscar", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-14", text: "The best guide ever—attentive, friendly, and professional from start to finish. He took care of us throughout the experience, anticipated our needs, and made everything effortless. Even with the monkeys, he kept us safe, taught us the do’s and don’ts, and made it fun. Couldn’t recommend him more! 🙈" },
                { author: "Wiebke", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-05", text: "I only did the Kecak Dance at the Karang Boma Cliff and it was SO COOL!!! Enjoyed it so much, for the alternative in the Temple you have to come 2 Hours earlier to wait in line because it’s so crowded. So this was the best Opportunity and it was just magical with the Sunset!" },
                { author: "Kristina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-03", text: "Had a great excursion with our driver/guide Angga! We had a lovely time tasting some coffee and tea from a local coffee plantation, touring the temple and the holy monkeys, and seeing the Kecak Dance. I definitely think it’s worth it if you have time to make it down to Uluwatu!" },
                { author: "Roopam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-02", text: "The Trip was Awesome and my Guide “DPUT” is so humble and friendly . He is on time and punctual to his schedule. He explains all the details in a very Historic way which makes me connect to the place in Uluwatu Temple . Highly recommended." }
