                { author: "Milena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-01", text: "Very fast experience but amazing ! Wr got the option with a photographer and he hides us underwater and provided food for the fish to come close to us . Gave us almost 70 pictures and videos !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/underwater-sea-walk-uluwatu-temple-and-kecak-dance/5357134/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/underwater-sea-walk-uluwatu-temple-and-kecak-dance/5357136/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Javaria", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "We were with Sana. He was very patient, took breaks when we wanted it, was very nice and gave us the most comfortable ride with a lot of new experiences! Also takes great pictures where we wanted it" },
                { author: "Shane", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-03", text: "Samba was a fantastic guide—punctual, knowledgeable, and genuinely invested in making the day special. We connected easily on the drive, shared a traditional Balinese lunch (suckling pig), and had great conversation throughout. He went above and beyond by taking me to quiet, secluded beaches on the Nusa islands, where we explored for over an hour. Later, he skillfully rerouted through traffic to get me to the Kecak dance on time, even helping with tickets and directions to the venue. The underwater experience was also a highlight—safe, well-guided, and fun. I added jet skiing and parasailing," },
                { author: "Louisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-05", text: "This was our favourite of all our Bali trips, such great fun. Huge thanks to our tour guide Joe who was absolutely fantastic. Joe organised the day for us so well, even down to where to sit for the kecak dance to get the best view. The view was stunning with Uluwatu Temple in the background and watching the sun set over the Indian Ocean was beautiful. The seawalk was great fun and suitable for people that are not too confident under water. Highly recommend this trip, and a bonus if you get Joe as your tour guide." },
                { author: "Lori", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-21", text: "Our guide Agung was very polite, knowledgeable, and respectful! He didn’t try to upsell anything and we were very happy with his service. Agung was prompt and was able have good conversations about politics, culture, and religion. I would highly recommend his services." },
                { author: "Tanya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2025-06-26", text: "This was a great experience as well and the people there were very friendly. But again just like the other watersports activities, no towels were provided when it was mentioned in the package that they were included. So we didnt bring our towels also which was really frustrating. Other than that, the sea walk in itself was very beautiful and something completely different." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 2, date: "2026-09-16", text: "gids te laat, ongeïnteresseerd, hij moest overal nog aanschuiven voor de tickets in de rij, te laat tempel niet gezien, seawalk wel fantastische ervaring, kecak dance ook mooi." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "Was amazing experience Highly recommended for everyone who looking some new experience" },
                { author: "Alexa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-01-04", text: "Another amazing day. It had been a pretty rainy day so I went parasailing instead of doing the underwater sea walk which was my first time and I loved the feeling of being up there and just being able to see everything from that vantage point. for the first time which was a really cool And took a boat with a glass cut out on the floor to see what’s all around and I got to feed the fish that surfaced. It was very cool to see. All while my guide Popo was an amazing photographer getting so many good photos even though I hate getting my picture taken. He was very informative of explaining everythi" },
                { author: "Fatma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Nous avins passé une magnifique journée, notre guide AGUNG BALI etait extrêmement attentionné, il nous a rendu la journée incroyable, on a pu découvrir la culture balinaise avec lui,les traditions,les coutumes, il est tres joviale, souriant,genriet tres poli,je vous le recommande vivement,on a beaucoup apprécié la visite avec lui lui du Temple Uluwatu et le show apres. la matinée sest bien passée aussi,merci a Agung d'avoir pris soin que nois changions d'activité,on a pu voir like des tortues et parrainer une tourtue. le seul point noir dans la journée est le nom sérieux et le mensonge de notr" }
