                { author: "Sandra", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Our guide (31st August 5:30pm) was absolutely amazing. He was very informative, and took especially great care from protecting us from the monkeys. Also offered to take pictures in the best spots. Thank you !", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8467438/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8467439/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8467440/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Our guide pudra I think his name was , was very knowledgable and gave full info on all parts of the temple he also kept some snacks to barter with the monkeys if needed haha , great experience in an amazing location", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8416525/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8416526/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/kecak-fire-dance-show-and-uluwatu-temple-entry-ticket/8416527/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Adriana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-15", text: "Great experience! Just be careful, there’s a lit of monkeys out there." },
                { author: "Nikola", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-12", text: "We had a great time at Uluwatu Temple as part of a sunset tour. We had two guides: one who explained the temple’s history and Balinese culture and another who kept an eye on the monkeys. The cultural and historical information was really interesting and educational. The temple itself is stunning with beautiful cliff views that were one of the highlights. There are also many monkeys living around the temple. It was great to see them up close but keep your belongings safely hidden as we saw several monkeys steal items from tourists. The Kecak dance was another highlight and a great way to experi" },
                { author: "Natalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Thank you so much!!!! Excellent communication, reliable, very kind and professional. It’s hard to find people to trust when traveling, I’m glad I found this company to help me with my tickets." },
                { author: "Stephen", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "Excellent performance. Our guides Rizza and Coffa were very good" },
                { author: "Shreya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Fabulous performance especially by the man playing Hanuman! Our guides Rizal and Koko (I hope that's the spelling) were also very helpful with the monkeys and very informative. Had a great time." },
                { author: "Alessio", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-29", text: "Unforgettable! Our driver Oddy was great. He took us to the Uluwatu temple, and explained the history of the place and what todo with the monkeys. Great experience. Everything worked perfectly." },
                { author: "Mike", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Had an absolutely amazing night at the Fire Dance Show and a wonderful day walking around the temple beforehand. Would thoroughly recommend doing while you're in Bali." },
                { author: "Ebru", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-24", text: "It was a good visit to the temple and the show. Our guide had lots to tell about the temple she showed us everywhere, explaining everything in detail, protected us from monkeys (some of them really aggressive) and took great photos of us. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Nader", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "I had such a great experience visiting Uluwatu Temple today! Our lady guide was extremely professional, friendly, and attentive throughout the entire visit. The whole team communicated very well and made us feel safe, especially around the monkeys. 🐒 They were always keeping an eye on us, protecting our belongings, warning us when needed, and making sure we stayed away from any potential danger. What I really appreciated was how thoughtful they were—they even offered to take pictures of us at the best spots without us having to ask. The entire experience felt safe, well organized, and enjoyabl" }
