                { author: "Satish", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-27", text: "Amazing 2-Day Nusa Penida Tour with FavoTrip and Guide Ketut We had an amazing 2-day tour of Nusa Penida with FavoTrip and our wonderful guide Ketut. Day 1 took us to the east side: Atuh Beach, Diamond Beach, Thousand Islands Viewpoint, and the famous Tree House Molenteng—each spot more stunning than the last. On Day 2, we explored the west: Kelingking Beach, Broken Beach, Angel’s Billabong, and relaxed at Crystal Bay. The tour was well-organized with private transport, a comfy guesthouse, and tasty local meals. Ketut was friendly, knowledgeable, and made the experience personal and stress-fre" }
