                { author: "Nicci", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "We got to see a Manta Ray and sea turtle. Amazing day with very friendly knowledgeable guides. The water was just stunning. Ricky and I had such a wonderful day. Thank you 😁" },
                { author: "Jack", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-09", text: "Couldn’t recommend it more. All guides were so helpful, friendly and informative" },
                { author: "Saffron", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-02", text: "Really brilliant tour - we were lucky enough to see a large number of manta rays, a turtle, and lots of other beautiful fish/coral. Guides were extremely knowledgeable and ensured a good experience whilst keeping us safe. Many thanks to all involved for a amazing day." },
                { author: "Dilani", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-19", text: "One of the best life experiences we’ve ever had experienced. We saw 5 manta rays and turtle and the guide is so caring make sure that we get time to spend snorkelling and exploring. This whole team is well organised." },
                { author: "Emma", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "We had a wonderful time, our driver picked us up from our villa and drove us to the port, we got on a boat to a beach then a short truck ride to green lagoon where we boarded another boat to see some Manta Rays unfortunately on this occasion we didn't get to see any, we had a wonderful time snorkelling so many fish to see and coral, then we got given a tasty lunch and afterwards kayaked through the mangroves. all in all wonderful day, good value for money i would highly recommend." }
