                { author: "Nadia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-12", text: "From beginning to end, this was a perfect trip! I was surprised at how great everyone was at communicating and with how prompt the team was every step of the way! My driver arrived right on time (actually, he arrived early!) and got me to the port early enough that I had time to get breakfast! The boat ride was seamless and on time as well. Once I made it to Nusa Penida, my guide, Rama was waiting for me. He was the sweetest, most patient, and professional person to spend the day with! I am a solo female traveler, so it was very nice to feel safe all day! He brought me to every spot that I wan", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/7121392/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/7121393/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/7121394/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hannah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "We had the most amazing day with Ketut visiting West Penida. Our driver who collected us and drove us back was lovely, the boat was comfortable and we had a smooth transfer. The places we visited were incredible and we thank Ketut for his knowledge, his photography and for making the day personal to us. He never rushed us at any of the stops, knew where to take us to avoid the crowds and was happy to move on when we were ready. We were lucky to have him as our guide. We are pleased to have had this experience as the stops truly are stunning.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/5841170/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/5841171/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/5841172/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Amelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-21", text: "Amazing experience! So this is a private tour and we were picked up promptly at our villa and taken to the fast boat port. We arrived a bit later so we had to wait from 8-9am to board the 9am boat. When we arrived Ketut was waiting there for us and he was super knowledgeable and so accommodating and friendly. Helped us find bathrooms when needed and he went above and beyond to help me find a few blessed Tridatu bracelets to bring home as souvenirs. Having the blessed bracelets was super important to me and he completely went out of his way to help me with this. Truly a great experience and wor", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/4686459/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/nusa-penida-day-trip-with-various-pickup-and-admission/4686461/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-11", text: "My guides name was Ketut, he was really helpful and kind. I got stuck on traffic and I couldn’t make it to the first boat but even so they didn’t cancel my booking and helped to half of my tour." },
                { author: "Manika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-18", text: "We had a great time during our trip. The pickup and drop off was very easygoing. We are very thankful to Rama for being so patient with us during the whole trip as well as being a great tour guide. Despite difficult road situations, the private vehicle trip was very favourable to us. Thank you a lot :)))" },
                { author: "Kelly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-27", text: "my activity was awesome and Lio was a great tour guide, friendly and accommodating, drove to pick me up so I would not have to walk up the 100 stairs I just walked down, very scenic sites and I asked him to go to the temple instead of east side and he said no problem . He asked if I wanted to stop for lunch and was very eager to please, I really enjoyed the day and it was even more awesome cause Lio was the Best!!!" },
                { author: "Wim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-27", text: "First time that we visited Nusa Penida. Our guide Ketut was already waiting for us when we arrived at the harbor. We enjoyed our day a lot. We were really surprised how beautiful and green Nusa Penida still is. There are very nice places to visit and we made some splendid photos thanks to our guide. He knows the island very well and gave us also a very good insight of the traditional Balinese way of living. The roads can be challenging but our guide was also an excellent driver. We had a lot of fun and time goes fast but we managed to visit and do a lot. Nusa Penida was our best holiday ever," },
                { author: "Andre", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Superbe excursion à Nusa Penida ! 🏝️ Tout était très bien organisé, avec de magnifiques paysages et des endroits incroyables à découvrir. Un grand merci à notre guide Lio, qui a été génial du début à la fin : très sympathique, attentionné, disponible et toujours de bonne humeur. Il a vraiment contribué à rendre cette journée encore plus agréable. Je recommande cette excursion sans hésiter ! 😊" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "Lio was amazing!! He made it a very enjoyable experience!!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-06", text: "Very fun, Lio brought us to all of the good spots and helped us with the placw" },
                { author: "Yazan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-26", text: "he guide was absolutely amazing. We had one of the happiest days of our lives. He was very helpful and took many photos for us. He spent the entire day with us in a very professional manner. We truly enjoyed our time with him — he is a highly professional person. I highly recommend using this app ، and His Name (MADE)" },
                { author: "Norbert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-15", text: "Nagyon jól szervezett. Minden gördülékenyen ment. Hajojegyek, transzfer, utvonal. A transzfer nagyon pontos volt. Ketut az idegenvezető felkészült volt. Mindenről elmondta a fontos információkat és bemutatta a balinéz élet hagyományait is. Segítőkész és közvetlen volt, és kiválóan vezet." }
