                { author: "Suzanne", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-08-14", text: "Gojo was the best! He took me all around Nusa Penida, drove very safely and was so knowledgeable. Was able to take great photo’s and videos." },
                { author: "Alexis", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-04-16", text: "We had the most amazing time with Agus Ubud on the Bali Instagram Tour. Amazing sights to see and an absolutely wonderful guide who helped us with everything the entire day! Definitely would recommend this tour! ☺️" },
                { author: "Andreia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-01-26", text: "I had an amazing day at Nusa Penida!! The guide was very nice and friendly. I was alone and he took a lot of great photos of me too. I definitely would come back!! Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Seth", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-04-01", text: "Bottom line….get this tour!!! and ask for Iwayan Kar!!!! probably the best guide we have ever worked with!!!! Our guide, Iwayan Kar, was amazing!! Ask for him by name and you will not be disappointed. This company’s tours are unbelievable! Very professional The 2 day instagram tour hits all the iconic picturesque sights in Bali. There is driving but never more than 2 hours between sights and our guide was a great conversationalist. Iwayan Kar picked us up from our hotel in an AC equipped van with bottled water for our family of 4. He was incredibly friendly and dressed in traditional Balinese" },
                { author: "Nicolas", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2020-02-26", text: "Tour muy completo, un buen resumen de Bali en dos días. Son 10hs cada día, así que, es un tour un poco intenso, pero si vas por un solo un fin de semana es exactamente lo que necesitas. Me tocó Iwayan de guia. La verdad muy buen guia, te explica las cosas bien y sabe donde están los mejores spots para fotos. Muy amable, siempre estaba atento a solucionar los problemas que podrías tener por ser turista (propinas para baño, no tener que hacer filas, etc, etc)." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-11-02", text: "This tour was amazing, definitely worth a try for anyone coming to Bali for the first time. Our tour guide was always on time to pick us up. The car was comfortable and air conditioned. The sites we went to visit were out of this world!" },
                { author: "Miyo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2019-10-26", text: "The first day trip was amazing. We could visit popular places in 1 day. Was a nice package! On the second day we visited the Penida island was a big island but not much to do. There were only 3 beaches to visit and was so hot. I recommend if you are not much of a cliff fan than no need to book as a tour you can visit by yourself no need a guide. The island had nothing much to see but took long time to travel around since the road was bad. I guess 1 day trip in Bali was enough no need to go to the Penida island. Maybe was not so fun because our second day driver always rushed us to hurry up and" }
