                { author: "Lionel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "We had an amazing time with our guide. He was very nice, knowledgeable and friendly. He even speaks some words of French and other languages. The trekking experience was also amazing, with a very relaxed and easy pace as well as breathtaking views of traditional villages and rice fields. I would recommend 100%, it was definitely a great and amusing way to spend the afternoon!" },
                { author: "Franck", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-01", text: "We met up with our guide and his nephew bright and early to start our trek. They had water bottles prepared for us. We then proceeded to take a 2 hour walk around the rice fields with some good explanations about what we were seeing. We got to see the different stages of the rice fields from young to mature. I recommend doing this trek to see the beautiful Sidemen scenery!" },
                { author: "Kate", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Our tour guide was very knowledgeable and funny. Great easy pace and beautiful views. Very affordable way to spend the morning." },
                { author: "Vanessa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "We had a wonderful experience exploring the rice terraces in Sidemen with our guide. The scenery was absolutely beautiful, and our guide was very friendly, knowledgeable and attentive throughout the activity. He took the time to explain the local culture, the rice terraces and the way of life in the area. The walk was very enjoyable and allowed us to discover Sidemen in a more authentic way. We highly recommend this experience, especially if you want to discover the beautiful landscapes of Sidemen with a local guide. 🌿✨" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-09", text: "The tour was excellent. Interesting, easy meetup instructions in the confirmation email, and a great guide. Adi is local with a great sense of humour and his lived experience tells the story of the village really well. If you have reasonable fitness the walk is easy. It ends some distance from the starting point as they say it does. There is a nice little rooftop warung at the end which was a great place to take a break and look back over the valley the walk takes you through. I am 61 and walked back to the starting point to collect my motorcycle no problem." },
                { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-14", text: "Perfect and knowledgeable guide, very friendly, with excellent explanations of the region and local farming practices. The tour is spectacular, the views are amazing, and having someone from one of the local villages showing you around also leads to many special and warm encounters with locals. This was among the best guided tours we have ever experienced." },
                { author: "Eloi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Daria was a very knowledgeable and friendly guide who made the walk through Sidemen rice terraces very interesting. The pace was very good and adapted to everyone in the small group (7 people). I appreciated the walk being in a part of the rice terraces with less tourists, it was super peaceful. Thank you!" }
