                { author: "Joaquim", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "It was perfect. The guides were very professional and nice." },
                { author: "Marie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-31", text: "I had a great 2.5 hours snorkelling..saw turtles, fish feeding and some wonderful views coral and fish ..Made and Wayan were very good and flexible guide/captain" },
                { author: "Iris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "The whole trip was a lot of fun. Our two guides were very nice in a real honest and personal way, enjoying the trip and us having fun as well. They also took care of some personal wishes. We can only recommend them!" },
                { author: "Sven", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-01", text: "We had a great time snorkeling. We were transported smoothly from the hotel to the meeting point with a very nice driver. On the boat was Wayan our guide who guided us great and even though the water was blurry due to the big waves and strong current het spotted a turtle and a clownfish. Because if the blurry water, we didn't go to the Japanese shipwreck, so thank you for being honest about that, so we went to another point. All in all we had a great morning and we're really looked well after. thank you!" },
                { author: "Eliška", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "i saw 6 turtles!!! which is obviously not a garante as they are aninals and move but it was so so cool to see and i’m so happy i got to experience this" },
                { author: "Scott", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "We had an absolutely brilliant snorkelling trip in Amed with two families, including adults and teenagers. We saw turtles, loads of tropical fish and beautiful coral, and the whole experience was excellent from start to finish. Our guide was fantastic and made everyone feel safe and well looked after. The team provided all the equipment, towels and water, as well as lockers where we could safely leave our belongings while we were out on the boat. You really could just turn up in your swimwear and everything else was taken care of. They also offered full face masks, which some of our less confi" },
                { author: "Markus", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-16", text: "Aboard a traditional balinese Jukung, Captain Imadeseper and diver Lumut have taken us to some beautiful snorkeling spots along the coast of Amed. It was a great first snorkeling experience with some beautiful views!" }
