                { author: "Kiana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-07", text: "We had an excellent time hiking up Mount Agung for sunrise! Our guide was very knowledgeable and kept great timing for us throughout the trip to ensure we made it at the top right before sunrise. The views were beautiful and we had a great experience." },
                { author: "Niels", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-30", text: "The hike was very tough but in totall everything was it worth. We were picked up on the right time en our guide was really nice! He helped us during the hike en we had a laugh. Also he made us a nice morning breakfast and he brought a lot of snacks for us. We did really enjoy!" },
                { author: "Benjamin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 4, date: "2026-07-25", text: "My guide Juan and my driver were super professional and made the experience great. Unfortunately the weather were not in our favor. To much rain made us cut the climb short. With that said. I strongly suggest you listen to the difficulty as described in the different climbs. Im 25, healthy and active. So i felt brave enough to try, after researching for a bit and watching a couple of youtube video’s. Even though i had no experience. Im not sure i could have made it to the top, even if the weather had been perfect. I quickly found that my running shoes had no grip in the mud. And without proper" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-04", text: "Magnifique excursion sur le mont agung. Physique mais tellement beau arrivée en haut. On a pu monter au premier point en moto. Merci à Kadek pour sa bonne humeur" }
