                { author: "Betta", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "We had a wonderful sunset snorkeling trip with Jil. He showed us the beautiful snorkelling spots . We were lucky to be able to swim with turtles at all three spots 🐢 and we could swim with colorful schools of fish. We ended up the tour with the stunning view of Mt Agung while we were watchong the sunset on the sea. Thanks Jil, you were a fantastic guide!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/7787515/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/7787516/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Milly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-04", text: "Great experience! We went as a group of six for my mum’s birthday. Agus and his team were so lovely, and made sure we saw some turtles! The equipment was great - the snorkels had fabric backs rather than plastic ones so they didn’t rip my hair out. As a woman with long hair this was such a bonus. Highly recommend.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/6504025/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/6504026/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/6504028/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Efrosiniya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-01-07", text: "Today we had a wonderful snorkeling experience with Jil Amed. As soon as I made the reservation the day before, Jil contacted me and sent a location link for the meeting point. He also advised me on the best time for the activity. Even though we were more than half an hour late, Jil waited for us patiently. The boat experience was great, and the children were truly amazed by the corals. Although I cannot swim, Jil guided me in the water and made me feel completely safe — both for the children, whom he constantly watched over, and for me, as someone who cannot swim at all. He promised us that w", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/5141481/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/5141482/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/amed-bali-snorkeling-explore-3-spots-by-traditional-jukung-ubud/5141483/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Nina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-14", text: "Everything was great, the snorkeling sites were amazing, and the sunset on the boat with Mount agung in front of us was breathtaking! Everybody was very nice with us, thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Enguerrand", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-17", text: "Good snorkeling time (around 2h30). you Can swim in 3 different spot with Various things to see. staff was great also ! video and photo for free also." },
                { author: "Anthony", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Exactly what we were hoping for. A chill time visiting the three key snorkelling spots by traditional Jukung. Great if you're already in the Amed area and just want to be taken to the right places with some lovely guides." },
                { author: "Miroslav", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-17", text: "We see white tip shark and three turtles very good trip 💯👍" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 1, date: "2026-09-04", text: "i was only out for 1 hr and didnt go to any of the places mentioned, i asked for a refund but havent heard back. very disappointing experience i couldve walked to the beach wnd hired a snorkel it wouldve been better" },
                { author: "Melody", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-08-28", text: "Sur les 3 spots ils n’y avaient pas grand chose à voir. Cependant notre guide et notre chauffeur étaient super sympa" },
                { author: "Carlo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-23", text: "Very fun! A must to do in Bali" },
                { author: "Benoit", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-19", text: "Snorkeling agréable en bord de plage et sur les spots de coraux. Ces spots sont d’ailleurs tous accessibles de la plage si vous voulez éviter le bateau. Possible aussi de réserver directement sur place avec un meilleur prix" },
                { author: "Fabrice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 3, date: "2026-08-11", text: "les 3 spots de snorkeling sont en bord de plages et ne présentent pas grand intérêt. Peu de poissons, des nurseries pour coraux (pour remplacer tous ceux qui sont morts), une épave. par contre la sortie en mer qui a suivi était cool." }
