                { author: "Elias", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "The activity was amazing and very different from the typical tourist experiences around Batur. The guide was super friendly, clearly loves what he does, and takes great care of you throughout the whole experience. He’ll show you hidden gems while always making sure you feel safe and comfortable. It’s definitely something to consider when visiting Batur instead of the usual hike or jeep tour. The dirt bike can take you almost anywhere, and you’ll get a good adrenaline rush along the way! There may not be many reviews yet because the tour is new to the platform, but don’t let that put you off—th", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8652631/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8652632/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8652633/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Oshin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "Gede was an amazing guide. Very humble and experienced local rider from Kintamani. Totally surprised me with his photography skills as well. Had an amazing time riding dirt bike for the first time, (which i still can believe i would have done) even though i had very little experience of riding a manual motorcycle, Gede made me feel comfortable and put his trust on me, made me more confident. Easily pickup and transfer. Driver was very kind and helpful. Overall, unforgettable experience.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8646851/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8646853/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8646858/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Said", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-14", text: "Es una super experiencia, para gente con experiencia en moto, si eres una persona aventurera esta experiencia es para ti, lo hemos pasado genial super pendiente de nosotros y nos ha dejado tiempo libre para dar una vuelta por el circuito. Eso si duerme bien la noche de antes y prepararte para madrugar. El chico que nos llevó no se sintió como un guía si no como un amigo que te lleva por su pueblo. Es una actividad poco común. Recomendamos aprovechar y vivir esta aventura.", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8710782/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8710783/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/volcano-dirt-bike-mountbatur-experience/8710784/1600.webp"] }
