                { author: "Camille", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-08", text: "Would recommend this adventure to anyone looking for a ton of fun and adrenaline! We had the absolute best time and would go again if we had time!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canyoning-adventure-in-sambangan-canyon-in-ubud/5741244/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canyoning-adventure-in-sambangan-canyon-in-ubud/5741245/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canyoning-adventure-in-sambangan-canyon-in-ubud/5741246/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Timothy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-16", text: "This might be the best tour in Bali, the photos cannot do justice to the beauty of Sambangan Canyon! The guides were amazing, each person on the tour had the time of their life. The meals provided were homemade 5-Star quality. And my driver was the most friendly person you could imagine. If you’re a lover of nature or outdoor enthusiast this should be the 1st tour you book in Bali!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/canyoning-adventure-in-sambangan-canyon-in-ubud/3106564/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Catherine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-30", text: "We had so much fun and feel very safe doing the activity. Totally recommend it :)" },
                { author: "Sarah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-14", text: "Fantastic experience! Rindu provide the complete package with hotel pick up, breakfast, lunch, all equipment and guided canyoning in an amazing location. Equipment is clean and in good condition. Instruction was clear and concise. Sambangan canyon is amazing. At 50+ I felt safe and supported to have a fantastic experience. Our guides made the day fun and the chocolate bar at the end was a hit 😉 Great value for money and highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Maarten", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-16", text: "The best canyoning we ever did! Also the GoPro movies and pictures you get afterwards are great!" },
                { author: "Elise", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-02-08", text: "We got picked up from our accommodation in Ubud and were provided with breakfast when we arrived. We went in low season so got the whole canyon to ourselves for the 2 hours! Made and Wind were amazing tour guides and we loved all the instructions and equipment demonstrations they did before we entered the canyon to ensure we felt safe the entire time! Waterfalls, jumps, slides, ziplines and swimming opportunities await, it's a truly incredible experience that I'd recommend to anyone visiting Bali!" },
                { author: "Janosch", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-24", text: "It was one of the best Things we did in Bali and worth every penny. Would recommend it nearly everyone :)" },
                { author: "Helena", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-17", text: "The guides were great, the whole experience was so fun. They give you a towel and soap, shampoo afterwards followed by a lunch which was super tasty. Would absolutely do this again." },
                { author: "Breanna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-05-01", text: "Omg! First off amazing can’t begin to describe this feeling experience! Our guides were amazing! The food the provided for us being home cooked was nothing short of delicious! The guides were very helpful and feeling safe the entire time. Being emersed in the jungle the way we were was something short of breath taking. Pictures don’t do justice! The experience it’s self is something we will cherish for the rest of our lives ❤️" },
                { author: "Robin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-02-22", text: "Me and my Brother did the Tour just yesterday and it was awesome! It was so much fun to slide, jump, zipline and climb through the canyon! Our two guides D and Z we’re really funny and really nice as well we totally had fun with them. The Breakfast and Lunch at the basecamp were also great and we had a wonderful view down the mountain over the ricefields. Altogether it was probably one of the best days of our journey and we’d definitely would do it again!" },
                { author: "Renee", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-20", text: "Had such a wonderful time! I booked this one with a slight fear of heights, only to end up being bumped up from the 15m to 35m abseil! They make you feel very safe and secure while conquering abseils, high jumps and zip lines. The breakfast and lunch were so delicious as well. Highly recommend this activity, even those who may seem a bit fearful at first it is absolutely worth it!" }
