                { author: "Kaitlyn", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-15", text: "Very friendly knowledgeable tour guide. A must do!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bali-in-1-day-iconic-temples-unesco-sight-all-inclusive-ubud/3100047/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bali-in-1-day-iconic-temples-unesco-sight-all-inclusive-ubud/3100048/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/bali-in-1-day-iconic-temples-unesco-sight-all-inclusive-ubud/3100049/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Ljiljana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "We had an amazing tour with Wayan. He was an excellent and thoughtful driver, as well as a wonderful guide with so much knowledge about Balinese culture, daily life, and traditions. We visited some truly beautiful and unique places, and Wayan made the whole experience even more special with his stories, explanations, and attention to detail. He was professional, friendly, and always made sure we were comfortable. We highly recommend Wayan to anyone who wants to discover the real Bali and learn more about its culture and traditions. Thank you, Wayan, for such a wonderful experience!" },
                { author: "Renzo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-15", text: "An intense day in northeast Bali. Our guide, Wayan, picked us up at our hotel and took us to visit three important temples in Bali and the rice terraces in the north. It was a busy but beautiful day. Wayan, our guide, was available and explained the culture and traditions of Bali to us. He was very patient and helpful. Excellent experience." },
                { author: "Joana", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-22", text: "It was an amazing experience, Made was an excellent guide, we learned a lot about beautiful Bali, its history, culture and about Hindus religion. It was a private tour so that we could explore also other places like a coffee plantation and the Handara gate. The organization was perfect, we had a great day!" },
                { author: "Dimitris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-20", text: "Our tour guide is an incredible person! Smiling, willing and very knowledgeable. We didn't lack for anything. I highly recommend him!!" },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-28", text: "Thank you for the tour. it was nice to have a knowledgeable local guide with us. We got insights from the local culture, traditions and explanations for all temples. We recommend this activity." },
                { author: "Gabriela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-09-08", text: "We loved this tour and would recommend it 100%. Wayan is a very experienced guide in Bali, who is starting his own tour on this platform, but is an absolute pro. He was very punctual, flexible and full of very interesting information about the sites, local culture and his family’s traditions. Not to mention he took amazing pictures knowing all the angles at all the places and was super patient. The places and temples we have visited were beautiful and the tour plan was well put together and went smoothly. Thank you Wayan for a fantastic day!" },
                { author: "Philippe", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-07-30", text: "We had a very pleasant day with a knowledgeable, serious, and dedicated guide who made sure to meet the needs of his clients. We highly recommend this excursion without reservation as it allows you to discover the iconic and absolutely extraordinary sites of Bali in one day." },
                { author: "Olivier", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2024-05-16", text: "Awesome day ! We started the tour on time from ubud. Our guide had water bottles for us in the car. We went to visit the 2 temples and had many opportunities to take pictures. Nothing was rush. The visit to the rice field was breathtaking. We had a choice between 2 trails. Both end at the same place. We had lunch next to rice field for an awesome view. We had plenty of time left before the sunset and stopped at the plantation. We discovered many tea and coffee with the free tasting. We bought 5 of the 14 we tried. For the last temple, il was a beautiful view but the sky was unfortunately cloud" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-28", text: "tourguide really nice person and take care about us in super way" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-14", text: "Incredible, the guide was very informative and helpful always giving information and advice about Bali. He knew the best spots for photographs including the most unknown ones." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-20", text: "スダナさんが、本当に親切で、丁寧な運転で、 途中でスーパーに寄っていたりして、本当に 楽しい1日を過ごせました。 またの機会も宜しくお願いします" }
