                { author: "Matze", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-09-13", text: "Unser Ausflug zu den Tempeln, den Reisfeldern und den Hot Springs war absolut erstklassig! Der Höhepunkt des Tages war zweifellos unser großartiger Fahrer, Gepun, vom Team Andrea. Von Anfang bis Ende bot er einen exzellenten Service und sorgte dafür, dass unser Ausflug unvergesslich wurde. Die Tempel waren beeindruckend und voller faszinierender Geschichten und Kultur. Die Reisfelder boten atemberaubende Ausblicke und die Möglichkeit, die Schönheit der balinesischen Landschaft hautnah zu erleben. Und die Hot Springs waren der perfekte Ort, um zu entspannen und die natürliche Wärme zu genießen." },
                { author: "Betty", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-08-23", text: "Le guide Nata a été merveilleux : à la fois très chaleureux, très communiquant (il donnait les explications nécessaires pour comprendre et appréhender chaque lieu visité, et discret. Il a rendu la journée vraiment agréable" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2023-07-23", text: "Day trip was amazing. Our driver Edi went above and beyond and was kind enough to take us anywhere we wanted to eat or visit. He is very well-spoken in English and very knowledgable. We learnt so much on the tour. He was very kind and is quite the character. I've kept in touch with him for my next trip to Bali !" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2022-09-14", text: "The tour was lovely. Nice to see a variety of different locations in one day. Our guide Abdi was informative of any questions we had and was very attentive to the whole family throughout the day. The attractions we visited were all lovely and interesting. Great places for holiday photos and showing off how beautiful Ubud is. Also, our tour guide had great driving skills for the journeys between attractions. He even showed us a great place to get Babi guling :) thank you for an entertaining tour" }
