                { author: "Pascal", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-10", text: "An unforgettable experience! We did the Mount Batur sunrise Jeep tour followed by the Black Lava fields, and it was worth every second. A huge thank you to our driver Nanang he was so kind, welcoming, and accommodating throughout the entire trip. He took great care of us and made the whole morning super fun. 10/10 highly recommend to do it" },
                { author: "Natalie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-08", text: "We had an absolutely amazing time on our Batur jeep tour! Our young drivers were so friendly, positive, and polite from start to finish. Everything went smoothly without a single issue. They took incredible photos for us, and we are leaving with so many warm and wonderful memories. Huge thanks to the team for their hard work and great attitude — they really did an outstanding job! Highly recommended to everyone! 🙌✨ Thank you for an amazing tour, Mawe and Mardi!" },
                { author: "Amina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Absolutely amazing experience! Our guide, Mawe, was fantastic. He took loads of great photos for us and really made the whole experience special. He played music in the jeep and even sang along with us, which made it so much fun. I would 100% book this again. Thank you, Mawe, for making it so memorable!" },
                { author: "Christ", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Absolutely loved this experience! The jeep ride up Mount Batur was exciting, and watching the sunrise from the mountain was definitely the highlight of our Bali trip. Our driver was friendly, helpful, and also took some great photos for us. Everything was well organized and we never felt rushed. Highly recommend this experience if you want to enjoy Mount Batur without doing the full hike!" },
                { author: "Balhaj", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Rudy très bon moniteur à était bien veillant super agréable gentil et souriant" },
                { author: "Mllaikhaf", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-09", text: "Wayan and rudi tout était parfait, à disposition pour les photos, il a été vraiment à l’écoute Nous avons passé un bon moment à accompagné de musique pour nous mettre à l’aise." },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-06", text: "One of the must-do activities in Bali! The guide was so friendly and explained everything really well. The views of Mount Batur were amazing, and relaxing in the natural hot springs afterward was the perfect way to end the trip. Loved it!" }
