                { author: "Ken", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-15", text: "Wayan provided a thorough tour of the area near the Benoa port of Bali, exposing me to multiple areas while narrating a very interesting explanation of the Balinese culture. His willingness to meet my personal interests while intermingled both Indonesian and local perspectives, including a temple where I had greater access than the ship excursion, enriched my experience, making this tour invaluable." },
                { author: "James", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-10", text: "Wayan was a great guide. Humerous and full of enthusiasm for Bali. He was very informative and his good english made for an enjoyable and memorable tour. We highly recommend Wayan for future visitors to Bali. Loved Bali, especially Ubud and the Rice terraces where we had a delicious Indonesian lunch. Felt very safe. AAA***" },
                { author: "Dean", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-06", text: "In one word: WONDERFUL!!! Our guide Komang was friendly, knowledgeable, considerate. He drove us safely to the specified stops and made sure to get us back to the ship as promised 1 hour before 'all aboard.' Komang met us at the terminal on time and shared with us the agenda for the day: temple, coffee plantation, rice paddies, waterfall, and quick visit to a beach. Coffee at the plantation and lunch above the rice paddies were both delicious. Komang served as our photographer as well eliciting smiles in all photos. While the day was long (about 7 hours), it didn't feel that way. Our conversat" },
                { author: "Alan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-24", text: "Despite the torrential rain, we had a wonderful day in Bali. Our guide Jose was excellent. He was friendly, helpful, polite, informative and went the extra mile to ensure that we had a lovely time in Bali. I would strongly recommend Jose." },
                { author: "Chester", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-23", text: "Our guide was excellent and adapted the schedule because of a downpour in the morning. scenery was beautiful and he provided interesting information on each site. Also, lunch overlooking the rice terrace was wonderful. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Ian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-29", text: "I would like to thank Rauh our driver for being such a great host and informing us about the island of Bali and the culture that their is here and making our day one not to forget. I would also like to thank Wayan for keeping us up to date with all the details that we needed when arriving on a cruise ship. I would definitely recommend this company for the seamless booking and day." },
                { author: "Ilona", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-03-07", text: "It was a real pleasure exploring Bali with Gusti. Besides his kindness and friendliness, he was one of the best guides we have ever had. His English was excellent, and he shared a lot of interesting information about Bali, its history, culture, and economic situation. One of the highlights of our trip was the delicious lunch with an incredible view over the rice terraces. The visit to the temple and the coffee plantation were also wonderful experiences that we would not want to miss. A special thank you to Gusti once again, but also to Wayan for the great organization. From the booking process" },
                { author: "Janice", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-02-24", text: "Gusti was an excellent and knowledgeable local guide. We really enjoyed our time in Southern Bali and he shared lots of information with us about local traditions and customs. What a lovely day, Gusti made the trip extra special. His Engglish was excellent and he was very interactive. Thank you!" }
