                { author: "Harrison", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-27", text: "We had a great time hiking up my Batur to see a beautiful sunset. We completed the hike very quickly so had to wait a long time for the sunrise and would've prefered a later pickup and more sleep. So if you're in good shape it might be worth asking them", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking/8381257/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Keira", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-24", text: "Loved this activity! The hike was challenging but so so worth it for the views☁️the tour guide was really lovely and didn’t rush us at all to get up, the coffee plantation was so interesting also with lovely tasters to try. Would definitely recommend!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking/6813854/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/mount-batur-hiking/6813855/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hyungyu", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "Wardana was our driver for the Batur trekking tour, and he made the whole experience so comfortable. He kindly lent me a jacket, chatted with us along the way, and drove very smoothly and safely. Really appreciated his kindness — highly recommend him if you get the chance!" },
                { author: "Chelsea", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-02", text: "Jay was a great guide!! Very good at taking photos. Do note that this is a tricky hike with lots of steep climbs. Definitely worth it and definitely verrrrry cold at the top - take a jacket!" },
                { author: "Romaine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-17", text: "Great experience! We were a bit unlucky with the weather, but the guide kept us motivated! Also thank you to our driver, Putra, who took time to share insights about Bali with us!" },
                { author: "Adam", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-13", text: "Highlight of my trip to Bali! My guide, Kam, was the nicest person and a great person to show us the way up the mountain. Highly recommend!" },
                { author: "Laura", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-30", text: "Amazing hike and caring guide. Would recommend to anyone, although if you have low fitness you would struggle, it’s steep!" },
                { author: "Luca", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-24", text: "Good experience overall with driver Depa and the guide too. Nice view and hike" },
                { author: "Grace", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-03", text: "We had a fabulous time with amazing views at the top! Singgih was a brilliant driver who got us there and back safely and Maggi was an amazing guide providing lots of information on the mountain whilst ensuring we were okay the whole way up. Highly recommend :)" },
                { author: "Angela", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-01", text: "Very well organised, from accommodation pick up to meeting with our group guide, Jay. Loved how each guide had a small group to lead which felt more intimate. We went on a cloudy day and witnessed about 15 minutes of the sunrise before clouds rolled over. It was still stunning though. Jay took us to some other cool spots at the top of the hike. Jay used his judgement to have us walk on the motorbike path as some of our group were struggling with going downhill on the steep hiking trail. Overall an amazing activity and one of the highlights of our time in Bali!" },
                { author: "Ida", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-04-26", text: "Very beautiful tour, with nice guides and good view… Our driver Toni was so sweet, and the whole thing was very coordinated ☺️" }
