                { author: "Christian", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "We had a fantastic day exploring Bali with Arsana. He was friendly, knowledgeable, and shared many interesting things about the places we visited and Balinese culture. We really enjoyed the experience and highly recommend him as a guide!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/saraswati-temple-and-ubud-monkey-forest-with-waterfalls/8545419/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/saraswati-temple-and-ubud-monkey-forest-with-waterfalls/8545420/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/saraswati-temple-and-ubud-monkey-forest-with-waterfalls/8545421/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Carina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "We had an amazing day on this tour! The itinerary was well organized and included many beautiful places. Our tour guide Tawan was excellent-very kind, patient, and always helpful. He shared lots of interesting information about Bali, the local culture, traditions, and daily life, which made the experience even more meaningful. He also took many great photos for us and never rushed us, giving us enough time to enjoy every stop. We highly recommend this tour to anyone visiting Bali. It was the perfect mix of nature, culture, and sightseeing, and our guide Tawan made it an unforgettable experienc", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/saraswati-temple-and-ubud-monkey-forest-with-waterfalls/7794186/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/saraswati-temple-and-ubud-monkey-forest-with-waterfalls/7794200/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Trupti", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-07", text: "Was really good..!! Bobby our guide was helpful, polite and very informative. He took a lot of care for us, showing, explaining things. Stayed with us when needed and also gave us alone time when we wanted it. Took us to beautiful spots and took pictures when we needed him to. Bobby was great company… Thank you so much.!" },
                { author: "Janine", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-05", text: "Indrawan was a fantastic guide. He was patient and very informative. We really enjoyed our day and the itinerary was great" },
                { author: "Erika", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-15", text: "Our guide Dwipa was very friendly and knowledgeable not just about the places we visited but also about Indonesian culture and history in general. He was also very kind and patient and we never felt rushed during our trip. He is also a very experienced guide and knew how to optimize our time to get to the different spots despite the usual heavy traffic in Bali. He looked after us very well and always made us feel comfortable during our trip. He is also a good photographer and helped us take some great family pics. Thank you very much Dwipa for our amazing and unforgettable Ubud trip!" },
                { author: "Charlotte", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-13", text: "We had an amazing day trip! Monkey forest was a highlight, our guide took us to one outside ubud where we could feed monkeys and have them jump on us Our driver Karba John was lovely, so knowledgable about bali it was a pleasure to spend our day with him" },
                { author: "Saniya", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-12", text: "Gus is such a lovely person and an excellent guide. So knowledgeable, helpful and kind. Very easygoing and had so many stories to keep us entertained. He tailored the experience a little bit for us as well. Such a sweet and friendly person. I highly recommend him!" },
                { author: "Danielle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-08", text: "What an amazing day we had with our guide Artawan. The tour was well planned, seeing so many sites and seeming to arrive at each location just before the rush. Artawan was the perfect guide, sharing so much knowledge and information about the island, cultures and history. If the sites and experiences didn’t make us fall in love with Bali, Artawan’s passion for the island certainly did. Thank you so much for a fantastic day and memories to last a lifetime." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐ We had an absolutely fantastic day exploring Bali with Tia From the moment we were picked up, Tia was friendly, welcoming and incredibly knowledgeable, sharing fascinating information about Balinese culture, traditions and history throughout the day. Nothing was too much trouble. Tia tailored the day to our interests, never made us feel rushed, and always knew the best times and spots to avoid the crowds. Tia’s driving was safe and comfortable, and she made sure we had everything we needed at each stop. What really made the experience special was Tia’s genuine kindness, sense of humour a" },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Arsana was the perfect guy for us. With him we have been able to visit really good spots just next to the instagram hotspots, less crowdy but perfect to see. He was providing so much information in such a kind way - he is our favourite and so was this tour. Asrana - matur suksma!" },
                { author: "Sonia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-20", text: "This tour was one of the best experiences we have had in our life! Our guide Ryan not only was super kind and patient but also very knowledgeable about Bali culture! This made our experience incredible. We were able to visit six amazing places while Ryan told us the details and secrets that otherwise we would not be able to know! He also took us the awesome pictures and in addition this is one of the few tours which included all the entrances, so we did not have to worry about nothing! Super highly recommended! 😃" }
