                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-13", text: "This tour was the highlight of our trip to Ubud. We saw so much nature, countryside, rice plantations and our guide Putu told us so much about the history of Bali and the temples. The waterfalls were amazing and we had a beautiful lunch at d carik tibuman with a little swim overlooking the rice fields. Each waterfall was unique and beautiful. Putu helped us down to the waterfall and took amazing pictures for us. The tour was everything you should see in Ubud. If you only do one tour, do this one!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/4208088/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/4208264/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Hirofumi", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-10", text: "プライベートで4つの滝を効率よく回ることが出来ました。入場料込みのプランを選んだので現金不要で快適でした。只階段が多く体力的には厳しかったです。", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/6597200/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/6597201/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/6597203/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "bernardo", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-03", text: "È stata veramente una bella giornata dove abbiamo potuto visitare le cascate di Bali; grazie anche alla nostra guida di nome Putu che è stato veramente gentile e disponibile proponendoci, nonostante non fosse nell’itinerario, una sosta per poter assistere a uno spettacolo tipico balinese. Consiglio vivamente questa attività!", photos: ["https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/4065806/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/4065807/1600.webp", "https://images.asiabylocals.com/asiabylocals/reviews/tibumana-tukad-cepung-kanto-lampo-and-tegenungan-tour-in-ubud/4065811/1600.webp"] },
                { author: "Shermin", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-13", text: "it was a very good trip well worth your money and time. waterfalls were the best ones and my guide Putu was very helpful and friendly. He explained a lot about Balinese culture and about the area. For me it was s good choice." },
                { author: "Claire", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-09-11", text: "very knowledgeable and experienced. gave us alot of insight on culture and traditions. much more than expected" },
                { author: "Hailey", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-05", text: "It was beautiful and very fun. Our guide was very kind." },
                { author: "Lisa", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-16", text: "Thoroughly enjoyed this tour! Our guide Bintang was so friendly. He arrived early to our villa and got us to each destination quickly and smoothly. All the waterfalls are beautiful but beware there are a lot of steps and some walking through shallow water to reach a couple of them." },
                { author: "Anna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-22", text: "Przewodnik Tresna był bardzo uprzejmy i zawiózł nas komfortowo na najpiękniejsze wodospady. Jesteśmy bardzo zadowoleni, wycieczka przebiegła sprawnie i przyjemnie." },
                { author: "Kornelia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-02", text: "Było super, przemiły Pan przewiózł nas po wszystkich najfajniejszych wodospadach :) Restauracja do której nas zawiózł była strzałem w 10!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-05-01", text: "Wir hatten einen tollen Tag mit unserem netten Guide Putu. Auf der Tour sind viele Treppen zu steigen, aber es lohnt sich. Wir hatten auch ein wunderbares Mittagessen unterwegs." },
                { author: "Paula", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-10-29", text: "El tour es fantástico para conocer las principales cascadas de Ubud y disfrutar de la naturaleza. He tenido la suerte de tener como guía a Putu, que ha sido muy atento y me ha dado mucha información sobre los templos, la cultura y la religión de Bali. ¡Recomiendo sin duda esta actividad!" },
                { author: "Kachler", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-09-26", text: "Très bien : - 1 cascade fermée le guide a su nous en proposer une autre magnifique. en amélioration : des ascensceurs (lol)" }
