                { author: "Tess", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-13", text: "Wowowow ! What a special outing - 100% recommend making jewelry with Alam Jewellers. Eric and Iwan made it such a special experience for myself and 6 friends, would do it over and over again!" }
