                { author: "Malari", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-29", text: "We had a great time on the tour. My two kids are big JJK fans and our guide, Nata, took a lot of time to talk with us about the show and to show us the real places in Shibuya where everything was drawn from. We even got to see pictures from the show and compare them to the real locations. My kids absolutely loved the tour. Thank you!" },
                { author: "Mark", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-28", text: "This tour was fantastic! My son is a huge Jujutsu Kaisen fan, and seeing his excitement made the experience even more special. At each stop, the guide showed scenes from the anime alongside the real-life location, then helped us recreate those moments with photos. My son was in awe at every stop and couldn’t stop smiling. Even though I haven’t watched the show myself, I had a great time because the guide was engaging and made it easy to appreciate the connection between the anime and Shibuya. If you’re a Jujutsu Kaisen fan—or traveling with one—this tour is absolutely worth it." },
                { author: "Steve", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-19", text: "We did many different tours while in Japan, this was the very best. The tour guide showed us many off the beaten path places, and we basically saw every scene of the Shibuya incident. Thank you so much!" },
                { author: "Chris", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-14", text: "The tour was such a cool experience! My boys and I are huge anime fans and it was our first time in Tokyo. Our enthusiastic and super sweet guide, Narta, took us to all the locations and scenes of some of the best fight scenes in JJK history. Narta brought the action to life and my boys were sooo excited to be there. Narta was also kind enough to give us some great anime and manga spots in the city. It was a perfect tour and intro to our time in Tokyo. %100 recommended!" },
                { author: "Leah", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-06-03", text: "This was an excellent tour, our guide was very friendly and knowledgeable. This was our first day in Japan so it was a great introduction to the Shibuya area. We purchased this for my daughter’s birthday as she is a huge JJK fan and she loved it, he showed all the best spots to take photos and even gave her a photo as memento for the tour. I highly recommend this tour if you are a JJK fan but even as someone who isn’t a fan of JJK I really enjoyed it as well" }
