                { author: "Janet", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-08-20", text: "Alyssa is a terrific guide. we had a wonderful trip up the ropeway and toured the garden. we then went to a lunch which we treated her to and she really helped with the language barrier. Great job!!!" },
                { author: "Cathie", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-19", text: "We had the most enjoyable day in Kyoto with our lovely guide Alyssa. I highly recommend having a personal guide as the train connections are complicated and time is saved by having a local to navigate. Alyssa was very caring trying to keep us cool on a very hot day and moving at our pace. She is very knowledgeable and informative. Thankyou Alyssa for our beautiful day." },
                { author: "Pramod", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-06-01", text: "My wife and I took the private trip to Kyoto, well organised by Allysa who is a senior guide. She turned up at the right time to collect us at the Kobe port that our cruise ship sailed into. She spoke very good English. Took us by various trains including a bullet train into Kyoto. She explained very well about Japanese history, life , religion and culture. It was very exciting day . She took us to a restaurant where we cooked our own lunch.. On our request she dropped us in the city centre of Osaka and explained to us how to make our way back to the ship. She gave us enough time for each attr" },
                { author: "Susan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-17", text: "Alyssa took us around the town with efficiency on the train system. She was easy to understand and flexible with our requirements. We decided to take bullet train to save time . Alyssa managed to make the best of our day" },
                { author: "Robert", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-05-15", text: "Allysa was a fantastic guide on our trip to Nara. Very helpful and knowledgable. Nothing was too much trouble. We had a fantastic day." },
                { author: "David", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-04-03", text: "We had a great tour. It started out great when our guide, Alyssa, met us exactly where we expected and was waiting for us as we passed thru customs. We were using local transportation and she had an excellent knowledge of the train and subway schedules to move us efficiently from the port to Osaka, about Osaka, and back to the ship. She was very knowledgeable and just as important, we were able to understand her which which did not occur with other guides we had used on our Japan trip. Would strongly recommend Alyssa's services to someone wanting to tour Osaka or Kyoto." },
                { author: "Michelle", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-03-08", text: "I appreciated the wonderful communication from our guide Allysa before we even started on the tour. She was very responsive. Allysa set a very nice pace and allowed plenty of time for us to see the sights. The locations she took us to were wonderful." },
                { author: "Donna", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-02-10", text: "Alyssa spoke English fluently, she did what we wanted to do and was lovely. Highly recommend her" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-11-05", text: "Edwin we a superb host/guide. Spoke very good English. He picked us from the port and returned us back after a wonderful day in Kyoto. We used a mix of local train, taxi, subway and Shinkansen. We saw all was wanted to see and more. Can’t recommend Edwin enough. Excited for our next trip to Kyoto." }
