                { author: "Rachel", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Our guide was fantastic all round! Very friendly and informative. He really knew his stuff about the castle's history and gave it the weight it deserves with his chilling storytelling. The tour was amazing and the information incredibly complete from all sources, from local beliefs to documented information. Our guide met us in a great location and even made sure we knew how to get back to our hotel, truly above and beyond." },
                { author: "Andy", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-18", text: "Niall was incredibly knowledgeable on all things related to Osaka Castle. He made the tour very interesting and was super approachable and was happy to answer our questions and show/take photos at the various locations around the castle. I would strongly recommend anyone to take part. If you are sceptic of the supernatural, going on the tour could potentially change your mind!" },
                { author: "Katharina", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-17", text: "The tour was really interesting and exciting. Our tourguide explained everything entertaining and spooky. Besides we learned a lot about history. I can highly recommend this tour." },
                { author: "Kayly", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-16", text: "This is a fascinating historical tour of Osaka castle in the quietness of an evening which adds to the eerie ambience. The guide is a wealth of knowledge and very personable and welcoming. Well worth going." },
                { author: "Kimberley", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-08-02", text: "My friend and I wanted a new experience and that’s what we got here! I learned so much about the history of Osaka castle and its surroundings. The tour was fun and I’d love to do it again next time I visit!" },
                { author: "Traveller", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-28", text: "We had an amazing and unforgettable tour yesterday! We felt so comfortable the whole time, and there were definitely a few moments that gave us goosebumps. The history of the castle is truly fascinating, and the way everything was told made it even more special. All in all, we would absolutely book this tour again! Thank you so, so much for such a experience!" },
                { author: "Alexander", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-27", text: "Marvelous ! Lots of scary stories. The guide (Neil) is both knowledgeable and good at presenting. Was rather long, covered a lot of ground (metaphorically and physically), was entertaining and educational ! Thanks !!!" },
                { author: "Ryan", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-25", text: "Nile was wonderful! We had the benefit of having him to ourselves instead of a larger group. Nile gave a detailed account of Osaka history, which is a bloody history, and interwove it with accounts of hauntings that my teens and I both enjoyed. I found his perspective of Japan as a foreigner living here almost a decade really fascinating. It made for a really interesting couple of hours and was much better than the self-guided tour we did a couple years back. I’ll also say that the castle by night is stunning. 5 stars. Highly recommended experience." },
                { author: "Julia", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-23", text: "The tour was really great and a good mixture of folklore/mythology and historical information. A really nice tour guide, doing a good job! It was interesting and learning about all the stuff, from how Osaka even got to exist and how Osaka Castle was build. About the historical figures belonging to the history of this place. Thanks for the great Tour!" },
                { author: "Erica", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2026-07-21", text: "We had so much fun on this tour! Niall, our guide, was incredibly knowledgeable of the history of the area and all of its fascinating history. We were able to ask lots of questions and weren’t made to feel rushed at all. We had a really lovely evening and I would highly recommend this tour." }
