                { author: "Anirudha", country: "Verified traveller review", rating: 5, date: "2025-07-01", text: "This was a wonderful / informative / introspective day trip. Seeing the A-bomb dome and museum was a solemn experience. The trip to Miyajima was wonderful! The tori gate and shrine were picturesque! Our guide (Tom san) was very deliberate and made every effort to give us good information. Really appreciated all his help throughout the day! The okonomiyaki lunch in the afternoon was an interesting experience! We loved it. The trip ended with paper peace planes / swans. A wonderful (poignant) experience that we will cherish for many years to come!" }
